(222253, 13095, 6458, '<td valign="top">Great picture, though the red border distracts the eye. Would have cropped the little bit of tan at the top and rotated the picture just a tad to the right.</td>', 'Great picture, though the red border distracts the eye. Would have cropped the little bit of tan at the top and rotated the picture just a tad to the right.', '2003-02-24 06:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
