(222256, 12798, 6458, '<td valign="top">Hmm.. The addition of water is distracting to this photo - usually it''s used to convey a feeling of freshness or morning dew, not despair. Without it, the photo would have been a 7 in my book.</td>', 'Hmm.. The addition of water is distracting to this photo - usually it''s used to convey a feeling of freshness or morning dew, not despair. Without it, the photo would have been a 7 in my book.', '2003-02-24 06:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
