(222274, 12937, 5628, '<td valign="top">I like the use of DOF in this shot and the title is used effectively to describe the challenge. The grainy background is also interesting. That said, I think the shot might have worked better with a stronger light source.</td>', 'I like the use of DOF in this shot and the title is used effectively to describe the challenge. The grainy background is also interesting. That said, I think the shot might have worked better with a stronger light source.', '2003-02-24 07:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
