(222299, 12829, 6458, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this photo, but I feel like there''s something missing. Perhaps it''s the darkness in the sky. Sorry I can''t be more specific.</td>', 'I like the concept of this photo, but I feel like there''s something missing. Perhaps it''s the darkness in the sky. Sorry I can''t be more specific.', '2003-02-24 08:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
