(222309, 12900, 5364, '<td valign="top">Are you implying that picture is out of focus because someone has taken off their glasses? An understandable reaction given the nature of the business card, but it doesn''t really work for me. (maybe because it''s my long-vision that is failing?)</td>', 'Are you implying that picture is out of focus because someone has taken off their glasses? An understandable reaction given the nature of the business card, but it doesn''t really work for me. (maybe because it''s my long-vision that is failing?)', '2003-02-24 08:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
