(222321, 12966, 5728, '<td valign="top">I can make out that this is a photo of a small boy in a corner but it is so small on my monitor that I can''t make it out properly. Maybe something went wrong with the upload do you think? Anyway he looks in despair so I guess you met the challenge.</td>', 'I can make out that this is a photo of a small boy in a corner but it is so small on my monitor that I can''t make it out properly. Maybe something went wrong with the upload do you think? Anyway he looks in despair so I guess you met the challenge.', '2003-02-24 08:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
