(222326, 13124, 5728, '<td valign="top">This photo is difficult to figure out as I can''t seem to make anything out in it because it is so blurry. But then again if you did this purposely then I am not sure as to the reason why. Maybe you want to cause despair in the beholder :-) Then you get an extra point from me. The color of the border doesn''t really fit to the photo.</td>', 'This photo is difficult to figure out as I can''t seem to make anything out in it because it is so blurry. But then again if you did this purposely then I am not sure as to the reason why. Maybe you want to cause despair in the beholder :-) Then you get an extra point from me. The color of the border doesn''t really fit to the photo.', '2003-02-24 08:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(222330, 12968, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a "despair" causing photo for sure. Dreary grey skies and depression!  A little bit blurry on the tree though.</td>', 'This is a "despair" causing photo for sure. Dreary grey skies and depression!  A little bit blurry on the tree though.', '2003-02-24 08:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(222331, 13063, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is so funny! You''ve made it look like in one of those cartoons where the pig has been flattened by something and is still alive, his eyes look alive anyway! I think the crop is a little bit too tight though. Did you help eat it afterwards?</td>', 'This is so funny! You''ve made it look like in one of those cartoons where the pig has been flattened by something and is still alive, his eyes look alive anyway! I think the crop is a little bit too tight though. Did you help eat it afterwards?', '2003-02-24 09:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
