(222354, 13121, 5364, '<td valign="top">Although I see how you can imply despair with this image, to me, it just comes over as an act of aggression. Technically, I feel that as the gun is very angular, it needs to be upright rather than leaning to the right. Otherwise it''s a good image.</td>', 'Although I see how you can imply despair with this image, to me, it just comes over as an act of aggression. Technically, I feel that as the gun is very angular, it needs to be upright rather than leaning to the right. Otherwise it''s a good image.', '2003-02-24 09:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
