(222359, 12808, 5364, '<td valign="top">As this is out of focus, I can''t properly get a feel for the despair. The broken mirror?? seems a bit redundant and seems to clutter the image a bit.</td>', 'As this is out of focus, I can''t properly get a feel for the despair. The broken mirror?? seems a bit redundant and seems to clutter the image a bit.', '2003-02-24 09:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
