(222367, 13094, 3569, '<td valign="top">Looks like my desk...</td>', 'Looks like my desk...', '2003-02-24 09:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(222368, 12902, 5158, '<td valign="top">This picture realy catched me. Although I looked at it several times I still feel a shiver. The submission needs the title, which is very strong. Compared to the other "death of a child"-submission in this one I can feel the feeling of the parents much stronger. <br/>Technicaly it is a great picture too, only the cross could be a tad brighter. Not too much of course, it should stay in the back, but I had a hard time seeing at the beginning. Light, color-choice, sharpness etc. are all great.<br/>My favorit this time.<br/></td>', 'This picture realy catched me. Although I looked at it several times I still feel a shiver. The submission needs the title, which is very strong. Compared to the other "death of a child"-submission in this one I can feel the feeling of the parents much stronger. Technicaly it is a great picture too, only the cross could be a tad brighter. Not too much of course, it should stay in the back, but I had a hard time seeing at the beginning. Light, color-choice, sharpness etc. are all great.My favorit this time.', '2003-02-24 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(222369, 12898, 5364, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see where the despair comes into this. Now if you were saying this is how you live day-to-day, then I could see a reason for despair! So maybe it''s just the title. It does need to be a little bigger though (the picture, not the pile of rubbish)</td>', 'I don''t really see where the despair comes into this. Now if you were saying this is how you live day-to-day, then I could see a reason for despair! So maybe it''s just the title. It does need to be a little bigger though (the picture, not the pile of rubbish)', '2003-02-24 09:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(222377, 12984, 5364, '<td valign="top">I can see your intent but, to me, it''s just words, and words don''t have the same impact as pictures.</td>', 'I can see your intent but, to me, it''s just words, and words don''t have the same impact as pictures.', '2003-02-24 09:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(222378, 12775, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. I hope you didn''t do that just so you could take this photo of it :-) You made the right decision by bringing all that foreground into the image. It wouldn''t have had the same impact if you had stood up and left it out. Good job!</td>', 'Wonderful. I hope you didn''t do that just so you could take this photo of it :-) You made the right decision by bringing all that foreground into the image. It wouldn''t have had the same impact if you had stood up and left it out. Good job!', '2003-02-24 09:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(222380, 12789, 5364, '<td valign="top">As I''m a atheist, this is a guess, but isn''t the crucifiction and subsequent resurrection a story of hope, rather than despair? It''s a well composed image, but it looks somewhat noisy.</td>', 'As I''m a atheist, this is a guess, but isn''t the crucifiction and subsequent resurrection a story of hope, rather than despair? It''s a well composed image, but it looks somewhat noisy.', '2003-02-24 09:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(222381, 13044, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny! It is such a simple shot but with a large impact! It both meets the challange and is also very humourous.</td>', 'Funny! It is such a simple shot but with a large impact! It both meets the challange and is also very humourous.', '2003-02-24 09:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(222382, 12992, 6230, '<td valign="top">The impact will be great IF ONLY we can see the subject''s face.</td>', 'The impact will be great IF ONLY we can see the subject''s face.', '2003-02-24 09:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(222385, 13078, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think that if you had made it slightly darker, it might work a bit better. As it is, to me, it looks like the light at the end of the tunnel, saying there''s always hope.</td>', 'I think that if you had made it slightly darker, it might work a bit better. As it is, to me, it looks like the light at the end of the tunnel, saying there''s always hope.', '2003-02-24 09:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
