(222388, 12813, 5364, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this implies despair- maybe I need to know what the business is that needs help. Technically I find the bright spot at the top left to be distracting.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this implies despair- maybe I need to know what the business is that needs help. Technically I find the bright spot at the top left to be distracting.', '2003-02-24 09:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(222391, 13044, 6752, '<td valign="top">aint that the truth :)</td>', 'aint that the truth :)', '2003-02-24 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(222392, 13057, 6230, '<td valign="top">There''s more curiousity than despair in the animal''s eyes. Also, that thing it is biting on makes me wonder what it is. It is a major distraction. Overall, it is a good take although a  bit dark around the neck.</td>', 'There''s more curiousity than despair in the animal''s eyes. Also, that thing it is biting on makes me wonder what it is. It is a major distraction. Overall, it is a good take although a  bit dark around the neck.', '2003-02-24 09:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(222393, 13065, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well done! That is a real look of despair which couldn''t really be acted! I take it from your title that she has the flu, poor girl. The crop is very here tight but it doesn''t really matter at all in this image, in fact I find it does it credit. It looks exactly like the shot of the woman lying dead on the floor in Hitchcock''s film "Psycho".  Choice!</td>', 'Well done! That is a real look of despair which couldn''t really be acted! I take it from your title that she has the flu, poor girl. The crop is very here tight but it doesn''t really matter at all in this image, in fact I find it does it credit. It looks exactly like the shot of the woman lying dead on the floor in Hitchcock''s film "Psycho".  Choice!', '2003-02-24 09:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(222394, 13051, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow macabre for sure, but it''s the challenge and you got "despair" jumping out of your photo, good job! I especially love the minimal lighting you have here which gives your image that extra dose of "depression" with all that darkness.</td>', 'Wow macabre for sure, but it''s the challenge and you got "despair" jumping out of your photo, good job! I especially love the minimal lighting you have here which gives your image that extra dose of "depression" with all that darkness.', '2003-02-24 09:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(222396, 12897, 6230, '<td valign="top">Subject could be taking a nap, in deep thought or just plain bored. Good idea and execution. May not fit the theme (can be anything).</td>', 'Subject could be taking a nap, in deep thought or just plain bored. Good idea and execution. May not fit the theme (can be anything).', '2003-02-24 09:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(222397, 12973, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty picture and the small smile you have on your face shows no sign of "despair" In fact you look quite happy. I especially like the crop you have here, with the head in the top left hand corner of your image. But it doesn''t meet the challenge at all as far as I see.</td>', 'This is a pretty picture and the small smile you have on your face shows no sign of "despair" In fact you look quite happy. I especially like the crop you have here, with the head in the top left hand corner of your image. But it doesn''t meet the challenge at all as far as I see.', '2003-02-24 09:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
