(222424, 13103, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not to brag (?) but I can still solve it in less than 2 minutes!</td>', 'Not to brag (?) but I can still solve it in less than 2 minutes!', '2003-02-24 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
