(222428, 12933, 3102, '<td valign="top">What an interesting shot!  I have only looked at a few of the entries so far, but I''ll go out on a limb &amp; bet this will be a Top 3! -10</td>', 'What an interesting shot!  I have only looked at a few of the entries so far, but I''ll go out on a limb & bet this will be a Top 3! -10', '2003-02-24 10:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(222430, 12817, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good show of tension in the hands. Your focus is on the books leaving the head and hands a little soft. This coupled with the hard shadow across the book below make the shot very dark on the left side. Perhaps a softer fill light to lighting the shadows some but not completely would help. I know that exams are ''dark'' and that you probably were going for that feel, I just can''t help think that there is a little too much darkness. your composition is good, but with so many items in the picture I don''t seem to have a central focal point. My eyes bounce all around the frame not focusing on any one item as the main theme. Hope this helps.</td>', 'Good show of tension in the hands. Your focus is on the books leaving the head and hands a little soft. This coupled with the hard shadow across the book below make the shot very dark on the left side. Perhaps a softer fill light to lighting the shadows some but not completely would help. I know that exams are ''dark'' and that you probably were going for that feel, I just can''t help think that there is a little too much darkness. your composition is good, but with so many items in the picture I don''t seem to have a central focal point. My eyes bounce all around the frame not focusing on any one item as the main theme. Hope this helps.', '2003-02-24 10:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
