(222873, 12923, 4055, '<td valign="top">I like this. Great composition. Lovely colours and the lighting is perfect. Your thin blue and then the black border is very good. Well done and good luck! High score is coming.</td>', 'I like this. Great composition. Lovely colours and the lighting is perfect. Your thin blue and then the black border is very good. Well done and good luck! High score is coming.', '2003-02-24 14:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(222875, 12941, 4159, '<td valign="top">Very much a capture.  Despair, though, at least to me, is a good deal more complex of an emotion than what this baby is feeling.  Can''t expand on that very well, hope you understand what I mean.  I do like your picture.</td>', 'Very much a capture.  Despair, though, at least to me, is a good deal more complex of an emotion than what this baby is feeling.  Can''t expand on that very well, hope you understand what I mean.  I do like your picture.', '2003-02-24 14:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
