(223062, 12887, 4159, '<td valign="top">Really depressing, both that this guy is sitting out there somewhere and that he''s being used for a photography challenge.  Picture is somewhat blurred.</td>', 'Really depressing, both that this guy is sitting out there somewhere and that he''s being used for a photography challenge.  Picture is somewhat blurred.', '2003-02-24 16:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
