(223085, 12782, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing find.  I really love the color and the different greens in the shot.   there are a few slightly different greens.  not a major different shade, but enough to make it varient.  The angle and framing/cropping is excelent. Looks despair-ish to me.  Kind of peaceful also.  Focus and clarity are wonderful.  This is an excelent shot! I really like it.  Something I could hand on the wall.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is an amazing find.  I really love the color and the different greens in the shot.   there are a few slightly different greens.  not a major different shade, but enough to make it varient.  The angle and framing/cropping is excelent. Looks despair-ish to me.  Kind of peaceful also.  Focus and clarity are wonderful.  This is an excelent shot! I really like it.  Something I could hand on the wall.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-02-24 16:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(223087, 12943, 3080, '<td valign="top">this definately has a despair feel to it.  The stairs make it look like the person is in a not so glamourous place, and the pose and look are sad and desperate.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I wonder how this would look also if you could have captured the persons feet wearing some old worn shoes or something.  might have had some heightened effect for the challenge.  overall a really nice shot. great focus and clarity and the use of black and white is good here.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'this definately has a despair feel to it.  The stairs make it look like the person is in a not so glamourous place, and the pose and look are sad and desperate.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I wonder how this would look also if you could have captured the persons feet wearing some old worn shoes or something.  might have had some heightened effect for the challenge.  overall a really nice shot. great focus and clarity and the use of black and white is good here.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-02-24 16:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(223088, 13037, 4015, '<td valign="top">good pictue, but a little small.  Would have liked to see it larger.</td>', 'good pictue, but a little small.  Would have liked to see it larger.', '2003-02-24 17:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(223090, 13026, 3080, '<td valign="top">looks old and worn, like it''s been there awhile too! I really like the lighting.  I think you did an excelent job with this.  under normal circumstances, I would recomend an ironed backdrop, but I think with the challenge, it''s kind of appropriate.  you did an excelent job keeping bad glare and reflection off the glass.  this is often difficult to do.  the angle and framing/cropping are great, and the focus and clarity are also good.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'looks old and worn, like it''s been there awhile too! I really like the lighting.  I think you did an excelent job with this.  under normal circumstances, I would recomend an ironed backdrop, but I think with the challenge, it''s kind of appropriate.  you did an excelent job keeping bad glare and reflection off the glass.  this is often difficult to do.  the angle and framing/cropping are great, and the focus and clarity are also good.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-02-24 17:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(223091, 13004, 3599, '<td valign="top">Forgive me if this is a different photographer but I believe this photo belongs in the Stock Photo challenge.  It is much better than the other submission.  This photo doesn''t reflect despair in my opinion.  I do think this a very nice shot.  If you had the soldier looking to the right I think it would have been better.  There''s too much negative space on the right for this guy to be looking forward.  This picture would have gotten an 8 in the other challenge but I''m giving it a 5 here.  Sorry I don''t see despair.</td>', 'Forgive me if this is a different photographer but I believe this photo belongs in the Stock Photo challenge.  It is much better than the other submission.  This photo doesn''t reflect despair in my opinion.  I do think this a very nice shot.  If you had the soldier looking to the right I think it would have been better.  There''s too much negative space on the right for this guy to be looking forward.  This picture would have gotten an 8 in the other challenge but I''m giving it a 5 here.  Sorry I don''t see despair.', '2003-02-24 17:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(223092, 12996, 327, '<td valign="top">Just a super shot. Love the grain, love the b&amp;w....love it all. Winner.</td>', 'Just a super shot. Love the grain, love the b&w....love it all. Winner.', '2003-02-24 17:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(223093, 13070, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I really like the idea, the composition, and the light. Nice.</td>', 'Nicely done. I really like the idea, the composition, and the light. Nice.', '2003-02-24 17:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(223094, 12841, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think i''d like to see the end of the nail to the left.  Otherwise, I like the cropping/framing/  the negative space to the right is good, and I like the closeness of the vertical crop.  the focus and clarity are good. color and lighting appear to be ok as well.  i guess my only minor complaint is the crop to the left.  overall a nice shot.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think i''d like to see the end of the nail to the left.  Otherwise, I like the cropping/framing/  the negative space to the right is good, and I like the closeness of the vertical crop.  the focus and clarity are good. color and lighting appear to be ok as well.  i guess my only minor complaint is the crop to the left.  overall a nice shot.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-02-24 17:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(223095, 13056, 327, '<td valign="top">Like it, like it.</td>', 'Like it, like it.', '2003-02-24 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
