(223110, 12933, 4159, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the lot.  I can certainly see the influence of the squares challenge.  Effective composition, the division into fourths is good. Very nice work.</td>', 'This is my favorite of the lot.  I can certainly see the influence of the squares challenge.  Effective composition, the division into fourths is good. Very nice work.', '2003-02-24 17:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
