(223117, 12923, 4159, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  It would''ve been really nice, too, if you''d caught a petal falling, but maybe I just want too much.  Good shot.</td>', 'This is nice.  It would''ve been really nice, too, if you''d caught a petal falling, but maybe I just want too much.  Good shot.', '2003-02-24 17:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
