(223121, 12965, 6520, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog! Only caged as a pup?I would like more depth of field or the dogs face more in focus than the cage bars. Gets a 7 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful dog! Only caged as a pup?I would like more depth of field or the dogs face more in focus than the cage bars. Gets a 7 from me.', '2003-02-24 17:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(223122, 12795, 4159, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, can''t see any active despair in it, though.</td>', 'Nice picture, can''t see any active despair in it, though.', '2003-02-24 17:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(223123, 12861, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think I would like to have seen a bit more room to the left here.  You chopped off her fingers.  I''m not a religious person, but when people see this statue, doesn''t is represent hope rather than despair?  Like I said, I''m not religious, so I wont claim to understand the meaning. I''ll take your word for it.  The lighting seems alright for the most part, but I''m not sure I like the light glare in the bottom right.  Otherwise, a nice shot.  Good use of the blank background, and black and white is a good choice also.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think I would like to have seen a bit more room to the left here.  You chopped off her fingers.  I''m not a religious person, but when people see this statue, doesn''t is represent hope rather than despair?  Like I said, I''m not religious, so I wont claim to understand the meaning. I''ll take your word for it.  The lighting seems alright for the most part, but I''m not sure I like the light glare in the bottom right.  Otherwise, a nice shot.  Good use of the blank background, and black and white is a good choice also.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-02-24 17:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(223124, 12886, 4015, '<td valign="top">Powerful image.  Very good.</td>', 'Powerful image.  Very good.', '2003-02-24 17:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(223125, 12950, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and use of negative space. I would have thought that, symbolically anyway, the stairs leading down would lead to darkness rather than light?</td>', 'Nice composition and use of negative space. I would have thought that, symbolically anyway, the stairs leading down would lead to darkness rather than light?', '2003-02-24 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(223126, 12861, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lots of interesting grays, and I like the cropping. try fiddling with more contrasts.</td>', 'Lots of interesting grays, and I like the cropping. try fiddling with more contrasts.', '2003-02-24 17:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(223127, 12996, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very good, disturbing image - nice tonal qualities and very good composition.  8</td>', 'Very good, disturbing image - nice tonal qualities and very good composition.  8', '2003-02-24 17:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(223128, 12808, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming that the badly out of focus shot was on purpose, however, it doesn''t appeal to me that way.  definately fits the challenge, drugs and alcohol in a rough time.  The area of white in the metal tin is quite bright compared to the rest of the shot and draws the attention there, and holds it.  can''t tell if the red liquid to the right is suposed to be alcohol, or blood.  guess it''s imagination time. :)  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m assuming that the badly out of focus shot was on purpose, however, it doesn''t appeal to me that way.  definately fits the challenge, drugs and alcohol in a rough time.  The area of white in the metal tin is quite bright compared to the rest of the shot and draws the attention there, and holds it.  can''t tell if the red liquid to the right is suposed to be alcohol, or blood.  guess it''s imagination time. :)  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-02-24 17:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(223129, 13014, 4015, '<td valign="top">Minor nitpick, top of head is cropped off.  Nice pictue though.</td>', 'Minor nitpick, top of head is cropped off.  Nice pictue though.', '2003-02-24 17:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(223130, 13114, 5391, '<td valign="top">As a pet lover, this completely breaks my heart.  Maybe a bit of bounced light on the right would have evened up the lighting and made it technically better, but the overall impression is very fitting for the challenge.</td>', 'As a pet lover, this completely breaks my heart.  Maybe a bit of bounced light on the right would have evened up the lighting and made it technically better, but the overall impression is very fitting for the challenge.', '2003-02-24 17:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(223131, 12923, 3080, '<td valign="top">despair? yup.  looks pretty sad to me.  The reflection of the shades in the vase is great.  I like how it brings the background into the main subject.  makes it all fit together without looking cluttered at all.  the color and lighting is great. focus and clarity are also good.  The angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  overall a really nicely done shot.  congrats and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'despair? yup.  looks pretty sad to me.  The reflection of the shades in the vase is great.  I like how it brings the background into the main subject.  makes it all fit together without looking cluttered at all.  the color and lighting is great. focus and clarity are also good.  The angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  overall a really nicely done shot.  congrats and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-02-24 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(223132, 13008, 2158, '<td valign="top">I may be wrong, but those hands just don''t look like they belong to someone desparate.</td>', 'I may be wrong, but those hands just don''t look like they belong to someone desparate.', '2003-02-24 17:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(223133, 12856, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very punny! For a "joke" shot, this is well composed. Try diffusing the light and omitting the fill light from the left. It might make a more dramatic photo.</td>', 'Very punny! For a "joke" shot, this is well composed. Try diffusing the light and omitting the fill light from the left. It might make a more dramatic photo.', '2003-02-24 17:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(223134, 13091, 3419, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo of a snow storm. You''ve captured the mood well, but I don''t see despair here, as I like snow storms.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo of a snow storm. You''ve captured the mood well, but I don''t see despair here, as I like snow storms.', '2003-02-24 17:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(223136, 12834, 6870, '<td valign="top">Church has an appropriately dark feel, though not quite "despair" . . .</td>', 'Church has an appropriately dark feel, though not quite "despair" . . .', '2003-02-24 17:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(223137, 12935, 3419, '<td valign="top">To be cold and wet is not a comfortable feeling. I would prefer different lighting on this, the reflections from your flash are distracting.</td>', 'To be cold and wet is not a comfortable feeling. I would prefer different lighting on this, the reflections from your flash are distracting.', '2003-02-24 17:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(223138, 13051, 6870, '<td valign="top">Bold, clear, simple.</td>', 'Bold, clear, simple.', '2003-02-24 17:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
