(223142, 13053, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well done. You''ve made the hands and stars stick out, which draws attention to the despair, and the whole image has a wonderful tone.</td>', 'Well done. You''ve made the hands and stars stick out, which draws attention to the despair, and the whole image has a wonderful tone.', '2003-02-24 17:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
