(223732, 12818, 6727, '<td valign="top">One of the few photos in this category that accurately depicts the subject.<br/></td>', 'One of the few photos in this category that accurately depicts the subject.', '2003-02-25 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(223733, 12797, 6172, '<td valign="top">You said it!  A very bad pun, and one that is not relevant to our challenge theme at all.</td>', 'You said it!  A very bad pun, and one that is not relevant to our challenge theme at all.', '2003-02-25 01:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(223734, 13104, 6172, '<td valign="top">Seems too dark to me, I can hardly see the bottle at all.</td>', 'Seems too dark to me, I can hardly see the bottle at all.', '2003-02-25 01:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(223735, 12996, 6172, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  Very simple, and yet, effective.  Good choice to go b&amp;w, I like the lighting except maybe that small dark spot in the foreground in the water.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  Very simple, and yet, effective.  Good choice to go b&w, I like the lighting except maybe that small dark spot in the foreground in the water.', '2003-02-25 02:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(223736, 12782, 6172, '<td valign="top">I love the photo, but....  Green is actually a color of life, not despair, generally that is.  How is this picture supposed to convey "Despair" to me?  Feel free to send any explanations, I''ve been known to change my vote.  Some times I just don''t understand.</td>', 'I love the photo, but....  Green is actually a color of life, not despair, generally that is.  How is this picture supposed to convey "Despair" to me?  Feel free to send any explanations, I''ve been known to change my vote.  Some times I just don''t understand.', '2003-02-25 02:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(223737, 13065, 6172, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem quite focused to me, and I think it is too dark.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem quite focused to me, and I think it is too dark.', '2003-02-25 02:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(223741, 12793, 6172, '<td valign="top">So, go to one of your friends house!  Ok, I just hate to see you out in the cold like that.</td>', 'So, go to one of your friends house!  Ok, I just hate to see you out in the cold like that.', '2003-02-25 02:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(223742, 13073, 6172, '<td valign="top">This is the opposite of despair.  You are showing the hope in despair, not the lack of hope.</td>', 'This is the opposite of despair.  You are showing the hope in despair, not the lack of hope.', '2003-02-25 02:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(223743, 12834, 6172, '<td valign="top">You are not depicting despair (the lack of hope), you are depicting the opposite.</td>', 'You are not depicting despair (the lack of hope), you are depicting the opposite.', '2003-02-25 02:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(223744, 12973, 6727, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t match the category subject AT ALL!</td>', 'This doesn''t match the category subject AT ALL!', '2003-02-25 02:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(223745, 13009, 6172, '<td valign="top">Definetely shows despair, good focus and lighting ( I like your choice of lighting ).  I hope this was only a simulation!</td>', 'Definetely shows despair, good focus and lighting ( I like your choice of lighting ).  I hope this was only a simulation!', '2003-02-25 02:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(223746, 12825, 6172, '<td valign="top">Not good focus.  Everything else was pretty good.</td>', 'Not good focus.  Everything else was pretty good.', '2003-02-25 02:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(223747, 12846, 6172, '<td valign="top">One of my favs in this challenge!  You said it without saying it, and in an impressive manner.</td>', 'One of my favs in this challenge!  You said it without saying it, and in an impressive manner.', '2003-02-25 02:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(223748, 12910, 6172, '<td valign="top">Is the time and date supposed to contribute to this shot?</td>', 'Is the time and date supposed to contribute to this shot?', '2003-02-25 02:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(223749, 13051, 6172, '<td valign="top">Lighting was very good, especially how it comes from the side to illuminate only one side of his face.  The only bad comment I would have would be on  the focus.</td>', 'Lighting was very good, especially how it comes from the side to illuminate only one side of his face.  The only bad comment I would have would be on  the focus.', '2003-02-25 02:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(223750, 12770, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  How did you get the background so pitch black?</td>', 'Nice shot.  How did you get the background so pitch black?', '2003-02-25 02:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(223751, 13064, 6172, '<td valign="top">Looks too much like a snapshot.  I can''t say how I would fix that.  It does convey the feeling of despair, though.</td>', 'Looks too much like a snapshot.  I can''t say how I would fix that.  It does convey the feeling of despair, though.', '2003-02-25 02:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(223752, 13040, 6172, '<td valign="top">A little on the abstract side, and, for this challenge, appropriate.</td>', 'A little on the abstract side, and, for this challenge, appropriate.', '2003-02-25 02:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(223754, 13014, 6172, '<td valign="top">It''s too humorous to depict despair in any serious fashion.</td>', 'It''s too humorous to depict despair in any serious fashion.', '2003-02-25 02:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(223755, 12873, 6172, '<td valign="top">One of my favs, I pick this one to win the challenge.</td>', 'One of my favs, I pick this one to win the challenge.', '2003-02-25 02:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(223756, 13056, 6172, '<td valign="top">Poorly focused, otherwise a good shot.</td>', 'Poorly focused, otherwise a good shot.', '2003-02-25 02:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(223757, 13002, 6172, '<td valign="top">It looks to me like that kid is having fun on the swing!</td>', 'It looks to me like that kid is having fun on the swing!', '2003-02-25 02:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(223758, 12881, 6172, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s very touching!</td>', 'Yes, it''s very touching!', '2003-02-25 02:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(223759, 13037, 6172, '<td valign="top">Yes, one of those guys is definitely in despair!</td>', 'Yes, one of those guys is definitely in despair!', '2003-02-25 02:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(223760, 13004, 6172, '<td valign="top">Despair for Saddam, not him!</td>', 'Despair for Saddam, not him!', '2003-02-25 02:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(223763, 13028, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  The blossoms are as lovely as the barbs are cruel.</td>', 'Very nice!  The blossoms are as lovely as the barbs are cruel.', '2003-02-25 02:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(223764, 12892, 6172, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it????</td>', 'I don''t get it????', '2003-02-25 02:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(223769, 13097, 6172, '<td valign="top">This could never happen in chess!</td>', 'This could never happen in chess!', '2003-02-25 02:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(223770, 12975, 6172, '<td valign="top">Bad focus</td>', 'Bad focus', '2003-02-25 02:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(223781, 13034, 6171, '<td valign="top">these suicide scenes are getting disturbing...</td>', 'these suicide scenes are getting disturbing...', '2003-02-25 02:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(223788, 12827, 6171, '<td valign="top">disturbing...  that''s nature for you, I guess.</td>', 'disturbing...  that''s nature for you, I guess.', '2003-02-25 03:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(223789, 12874, 6171, '<td valign="top">ugh... more suicide scenes...</td>', 'ugh... more suicide scenes...', '2003-02-25 03:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(223790, 12975, 6171, '<td valign="top">ugh...  more suicides...  people are so grim...</td>', 'ugh...  more suicides...  people are so grim...', '2003-02-25 03:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(223791, 12903, 6171, '<td valign="top">the calculator isn''t going to help.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'the calculator isn''t going to help.   ', '2003-02-25 03:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(223792, 12977, 6171, '<td valign="top">I am really afraid of some of the members now...</td>', 'I am really afraid of some of the members now...', '2003-02-25 03:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(223794, 12995, 6171, '<td valign="top">cheesy...  <br/> <br/></td>', 'cheesy...   ', '2003-02-25 03:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(223796, 12930, 6173, '<td valign="top">looks like a pain, a loss</td>', 'looks like a pain, a loss', '2003-02-25 03:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(223797, 13042, 6171, '<td valign="top">ack...  no more suicide scenes, please!</td>', 'ack...  no more suicide scenes, please!', '2003-02-25 03:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(223800, 13094, 6173, '<td valign="top">nice bw; looks desparate</td>', 'nice bw; looks desparate', '2003-02-25 03:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(223801, 12825, 6171, '<td valign="top">uh...  right...</td>', 'uh...  right...', '2003-02-25 03:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(223802, 12780, 6171, '<td valign="top">hmm...  ducks get tumors too, i guess...  <br/> <br/></td>', 'hmm...  ducks get tumors too, i guess...   ', '2003-02-25 03:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(223803, 12975, 5728, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do something similar to this one but couldn''t think of anything which would create a kick as you have done here. You''ve made a simple shot create an impact. Good one, I wish I could read a little more of the note though, I can''t really make out if it is a suicide note, or is it the reason for committing suicide. A "Dear John" or something? I would also have prefered the whole note to be in focus, the foreground part is just a tad blurry as are the pills on the far right.  It''s a great crop and well thought up image, good one.</td>', 'I wanted to do something similar to this one but couldn''t think of anything which would create a kick as you have done here. You''ve made a simple shot create an impact. Good one, I wish I could read a little more of the note though, I can''t really make out if it is a suicide note, or is it the reason for committing suicide. A "Dear John" or something? I would also have prefered the whole note to be in focus, the foreground part is just a tad blurry as are the pills on the far right.  It''s a great crop and well thought up image, good one.', '2003-02-25 03:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(223804, 12841, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a well composed photo and the unusual cropping actually enhances it in my opinion. I had to think about it for a while to get the relevance to the "despair" challenge, but I got it in the end from your title, the nails and the cross image. Good luck on this one and I hope everyone else will understand it.</td>', 'This is a well composed photo and the unusual cropping actually enhances it in my opinion. I had to think about it for a while to get the relevance to the "despair" challenge, but I got it in the end from your title, the nails and the cross image. Good luck on this one and I hope everyone else will understand it.', '2003-02-25 03:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(223806, 12780, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is so sad and you can even see the sadness in his eyes. You''ve captured this well it really stirs emotions. Challenge excellently met here, good one.</td>', 'This is so sad and you can even see the sadness in his eyes. You''ve captured this well it really stirs emotions. Challenge excellently met here, good one.', '2003-02-25 03:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(223807, 12917, 5728, '<td valign="top">My condolences to you on the loss of your father. This photo along with the title is total despair and moves me emotionally!</td>', 'My condolences to you on the loss of your father. This photo along with the title is total despair and moves me emotionally!', '2003-02-25 03:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(223808, 13029, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think it must be me, but I don''t get a feeling of despair from this. It''s probably due to the gentleman being upright - standing tall. The grain effect is appropriate for this image, but the sepia tone doesn''t feel quite right. I think it''s because sepia is usually the colour of old photos, but this has very modern elements in it:- the buildings, wide empty road and the shopping trolly.</td>', 'I think it must be me, but I don''t get a feeling of despair from this. It''s probably due to the gentleman being upright - standing tall. The grain effect is appropriate for this image, but the sepia tone doesn''t feel quite right. I think it''s because sepia is usually the colour of old photos, but this has very modern elements in it:- the buildings, wide empty road and the shopping trolly.', '2003-02-25 03:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(223810, 13050, 5364, '<td valign="top">This is very effective. You have managed to capture the feeling very well with a sad looking kitten, isolated like this.</td>', 'This is very effective. You have managed to capture the feeling very well with a sad looking kitten, isolated like this.', '2003-02-25 03:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(223812, 13034, 4927, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a very disturbing photo. Technically, lighting and composition look good. I can''t believe that your subject willingly leaned her head against the toilet, and put her hair in it (that''s really disgusting)!</td>', 'Wow, this is a very disturbing photo. Technically, lighting and composition look good. I can''t believe that your subject willingly leaned her head against the toilet, and put her hair in it (that''s really disgusting)!', '2003-02-25 03:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(223813, 13126, 5364, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get a sense of despair from this. To me it''s just a chore, so get on with it! (Here speaks someone who will see at most 2 inches of snow a year)<br/> <br/>Technically, it is well exposed and composed.</td>', 'I don''t really get a sense of despair from this. To me it''s just a chore, so get on with it! (Here speaks someone who will see at most 2 inches of snow a year) Technically, it is well exposed and composed.', '2003-02-25 03:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(223814, 12974, 5364, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it''s because I''m male, but a toilet, regardless of condition, doesn''t represent despair for me. It''s more likely to repesent a sense of relief!<br/> <br/>I like the harsh nature of the lighting, and the angle does make it a more dramatic picture.</td>', 'Perhaps it''s because I''m male, but a toilet, regardless of condition, doesn''t represent despair for me. It''s more likely to repesent a sense of relief! I like the harsh nature of the lighting, and the angle does make it a more dramatic picture.', '2003-02-25 04:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(223816, 13013, 5364, '<td valign="top">Sorry, it just doesn''t work for me. Displaying it as a negative just confused me.</td>', 'Sorry, it just doesn''t work for me. Displaying it as a negative just confused me.', '2003-02-25 04:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(223818, 12805, 5364, '<td valign="top">The title and picture don''t really work together for me. The problem is that where I live, the weather tends to come from the direction of the bright area in your picture, so to me it looks like the storm has passed- here comes the sun.<br/> <br/>That aside, it''s a good image.</td>', 'The title and picture don''t really work together for me. The problem is that where I live, the weather tends to come from the direction of the bright area in your picture, so to me it looks like the storm has passed- here comes the sun. That aside, it''s a good image.', '2003-02-25 04:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(223833, 12846, 5728, '<td valign="top">This photo really depicts a dreary and dismal day, and that sure is despair. Good shot. I really don''t like such dark photos, but this one meets the challenge perfectly and had it been lighter the impact would have been lost. Great crop too!</td>', 'This photo really depicts a dreary and dismal day, and that sure is despair. Good shot. I really don''t like such dark photos, but this one meets the challenge perfectly and had it been lighter the impact would have been lost. Great crop too!', '2003-02-25 05:01:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(223835, 12825, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea I love it! You have met the challenge head on with this image. At first I thought you had both his and her rings there but I see they are the same size so they must be both hers. I mean it wouldn''t have made sense if his ring had also been there. Great composition, the angles are very harmonizing. Congratulations.</td>', 'Excellent idea I love it! You have met the challenge head on with this image. At first I thought you had both his and her rings there but I see they are the same size so they must be both hers. I mean it wouldn''t have made sense if his ring had also been there. Great composition, the angles are very harmonizing. Congratulations.', '2003-02-25 05:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(223839, 12816, 5728, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this image, the angles and the crop appeal to me. Well done. Does a white rose mean despair? Maybe in your country I am not sure so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. Good one.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this image, the angles and the crop appeal to me. Well done. Does a white rose mean despair? Maybe in your country I am not sure so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. Good one.', '2003-02-25 05:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(223865, 13102, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a very good picture of the cat, but it doesn''t meet the challenge very well. I don''t see despair here, I see a contented cat. In fact this would have done well in the Stock Photo challenge- I could quite easliy see this ending up on a cat calendar.</td>', 'It''s a very good picture of the cat, but it doesn''t meet the challenge very well. I don''t see despair here, I see a contented cat. In fact this would have done well in the Stock Photo challenge- I could quite easliy see this ending up on a cat calendar.', '2003-02-25 05:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(223866, 13031, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a good image that does seem to fit the challenge. Two things don''t seem quite right however. The shape of the hand suggests to me that the container should be above the hand, or possibly still loosly held, and for some reason the fingernails are attracting my attention because of their dark colour.</td>', 'It''s a good image that does seem to fit the challenge. Two things don''t seem quite right however. The shape of the hand suggests to me that the container should be above the hand, or possibly still loosly held, and for some reason the fingernails are attracting my attention because of their dark colour.', '2003-02-25 05:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(223878, 12989, 5364, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand how this conveys despair. Send me a message if you want to explain it.<br/> <br/>As a picture it is good. The exposure and focus are correct, and I like the way it sweeps across the frame.</td>', 'I don''t understand how this conveys despair. Send me a message if you want to explain it. As a picture it is good. The exposure and focus are correct, and I like the way it sweeps across the frame.', '2003-02-25 06:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(223880, 13118, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a very sad to only live for 6 days, and it must have been a bad time for the parents,  but the fact that I had to do arithmetic to work that out (and in a foriegn date format) put my mind into a logical state and away from the emotions.<br/> <br/>Technically you have done well with the exposure and focus, but you have have cropped it a little tight on the right-hand side. (I am assuming the engraving doesn''t continue much further)</td>', 'It''s a very sad to only live for 6 days, and it must have been a bad time for the parents,  but the fact that I had to do arithmetic to work that out (and in a foriegn date format) put my mind into a logical state and away from the emotions. Technically you have done well with the exposure and focus, but you have have cropped it a little tight on the right-hand side. (I am assuming the engraving doesn''t continue much further)', '2003-02-25 06:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(223885, 13003, 5364, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a feeling of despair here. You may be low on energy, but you have a solution, what is there to despair about?<br/> <br/>As a picture I like the composition having the solar panel in the foreground, and the depth of field is good having the background a bit soft. The pointing finger, however, is distracting. I keep looking over to the right to find what is being pointed at. I realize that it''s not pointing, it''s pushing a button, but because the button is so dark compared to the hand, pointing is the impression I get.</td>', 'I don''t get a feeling of despair here. You may be low on energy, but you have a solution, what is there to despair about? As a picture I like the composition having the solar panel in the foreground, and the depth of field is good having the background a bit soft. The pointing finger, however, is distracting. I keep looking over to the right to find what is being pointed at. I realize that it''s not pointing, it''s pushing a button, but because the button is so dark compared to the hand, pointing is the impression I get.', '2003-02-25 07:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(223888, 13095, 5364, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I see too much despair in this picture. I think the small person is enjoying themselves too much.</td>', 'I''m not sure I see too much despair in this picture. I think the small person is enjoying themselves too much.', '2003-02-25 07:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(223889, 13016, 5364, '<td valign="top">For me, abstraction like this doesn''t convey any emotions. That said, I like the image. It''s the kind of picture I''d be happy to hang on my wall.</td>', 'For me, abstraction like this doesn''t convey any emotions. That said, I like the image. It''s the kind of picture I''d be happy to hang on my wall.', '2003-02-25 07:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(223905, 12887, 2978, '<td valign="top">Good candid</td>', 'Good candid', '2003-02-25 08:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(223951, 13042, 5629, '<td valign="top">i think this could have been a really powerful picture if we were able to see a little more of the person in the background (like maybe a spot light on her eyes).</td>', 'i think this could have been a really powerful picture if we were able to see a little more of the person in the background (like maybe a spot light on her eyes).', '2003-02-25 08:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(223964, 12912, 5266, '<td valign="top">Are you sorry, upset?  This just seems to be a photo of someone''s art.  I like the red effect.</td>', 'Are you sorry, upset?  This just seems to be a photo of someone''s art.  I like the red effect.', '2003-02-25 09:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(223967, 12996, 5654, '<td valign="top">Being able to see the arm, above the elbow, spoils the impact of the image for me.</td>', 'Being able to see the arm, above the elbow, spoils the impact of the image for me.', '2003-02-25 09:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(223968, 12965, 5654, '<td valign="top">This one will speak to dog lovers.</td>', 'This one will speak to dog lovers.', '2003-02-25 09:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(223971, 13034, 3942, '<td valign="top">Not really a nice story, but I like your shot. The lightning through the hidden window works great and is highlighting the subject. The models color and the lower saturation of the rest is well done too. The high camera position is IMO well deliberated. It brings some distance between the viewer and the sad scenario. Perhaps I would have cropped a little closer on the left side of your shot. IMHO there ist too much uninteresting space.  The victory sign of her hand looks a little overstated, but that''s only marginal. Great work! - 9</td>', 'Not really a nice story, but I like your shot. The lightning through the hidden window works great and is highlighting the subject. The models color and the lower saturation of the rest is well done too. The high camera position is IMO well deliberated. It brings some distance between the viewer and the sad scenario. Perhaps I would have cropped a little closer on the left side of your shot. IMHO there ist too much uninteresting space.  The victory sign of her hand looks a little overstated, but that''s only marginal. Great work! - 9', '2003-02-25 09:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(223976, 12816, 6727, '<td valign="top">While this is a lovely photograph, I don''t see how it depicts DESPAIR. Would have done much better in an appropriately-named challenge.</td>', 'While this is a lovely photograph, I don''t see how it depicts DESPAIR. Would have done much better in an appropriately-named challenge.', '2003-02-25 09:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(223987, 13029, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent image.  I like the grain and the tonal range.</td>', 'Excellent image.  I like the grain and the tonal range.', '2003-02-25 10:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(223988, 12871, 4829, '<td valign="top">Poor kitty! Would be a bit nicer if it wasn''t out of focus, nice idea though.</td>', 'Poor kitty! Would be a bit nicer if it wasn''t out of focus, nice idea though.', '2003-02-25 10:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(223990, 12887, 4829, '<td valign="top">Awesome, nice candid, meets the challenge! Where was this taken?</td>', 'Awesome, nice candid, meets the challenge! Where was this taken?', '2003-02-25 10:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(224001, 13085, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming this shot is setup since this would have been cruel in the extreme to shoot if she truely felt that way.  To your model''s credit,  it is pulled off well.  The grain works for you here. Good job</td>', 'I''m assuming this shot is setup since this would have been cruel in the extreme to shoot if she truely felt that way.  To your model''s credit,  it is pulled off well.  The grain works for you here. Good job', '2003-02-25 10:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(224036, 12966, 4366, '<td valign="top">1</td>', '1', '2003-02-25 11:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
