(224163, 12947, 4564, '<td valign="top">the idea is nice. But the image would truely benefit from a more dramatic lighting. The lighting as it is is quite plain and uninteresting to look at.  That''s the thing with innanimated objects: the surrounding and lighting is very important to bring out the emotion you want to vehiculate through your image.  There are some other chess shots in this challenge, as you probably saw.  There''s two with excellent lighting.  Look for them for future ispiration.  3</td>', 'the idea is nice. But the image would truely benefit from a more dramatic lighting. The lighting as it is is quite plain and uninteresting to look at.  That''s the thing with innanimated objects: the surrounding and lighting is very important to bring out the emotion you want to vehiculate through your image.  There are some other chess shots in this challenge, as you probably saw.  There''s two with excellent lighting.  Look for them for future ispiration.  3', '2003-02-25 13:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
