(224172, 12906, 4564, '<td valign="top">Very well shot. Without the title, there''s no much despair in the photo though...  8/10, but because (to me) it doesn''t meet with the challenge on its own, I give it a 6/10</td>', 'Very well shot. Without the title, there''s no much despair in the photo though...  8/10, but because (to me) it doesn''t meet with the challenge on its own, I give it a 6/10', '2003-02-25 13:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
