(224186, 13027, 4210, '<td valign="top">People huddling in a corner while nude seems to be a theme this challenge. Two problems: If he''s naked, why the watch? Also, if you''re upset, you generally don''t strip, you find more layers. A blanket. Crawl into bed. Something in order to hide. (That''s why you''re in the corner. You''re hiding. So why be naked?) Great lighting on this shot though.</td>', 'People huddling in a corner while nude seems to be a theme this challenge. Two problems: If he''s naked, why the watch? Also, if you''re upset, you generally don''t strip, you find more layers. A blanket. Crawl into bed. Something in order to hide. (That''s why you''re in the corner. You''re hiding. So why be naked?) Great lighting on this shot though.', '2003-02-25 13:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
