(224323, 12986, 6701, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture, and detail.  I would like it if the deeper blacks were perhaps darker.  It''s hard to convey human emotions effectively to animals (I think it is anyway), but this shot does it well.</td>', 'Wonderful texture, and detail.  I would like it if the deeper blacks were perhaps darker.  It''s hard to convey human emotions effectively to animals (I think it is anyway), but this shot does it well.', '2003-02-25 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
