(224654, 12943, 6370, '<td valign="top">decent photo, sharp on the details.  B&amp;W was a common choice for these despair photo''s (funny that) and works well with this photo.  This subject was a little overplayed this week, unfortunately, which will probably bring your score down some as people get bored with looking at hunched-over people.  Hope your photo was closer to the top of the voting page.</td>', 'decent photo, sharp on the details.  B&W was a common choice for these despair photo''s (funny that) and works well with this photo.  This subject was a little overplayed this week, unfortunately, which will probably bring your score down some as people get bored with looking at hunched-over people.  Hope your photo was closer to the top of the voting page.', '2003-02-26 01:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(224657, 12894, 6171, '<td valign="top">When playing a game from the beginning, there is no way to get the king into this situation.  It couldn''t happen.  It''s impossible.  And I don''t even know that much about chess.  Think about it this way, you can remove all kinds of pieces and still have it be checkmate.  Remove the knights.  Remove the left bishop.  Still checkmate.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'When playing a game from the beginning, there is no way to get the king into this situation.  It couldn''t happen.  It''s impossible.  And I don''t even know that much about chess.  Think about it this way, you can remove all kinds of pieces and still have it be checkmate.  Remove the knights.  Remove the left bishop.  Still checkmate.   ', '2003-02-26 03:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(224658, 13031, 6171, '<td valign="top">no more suicides!!!  aghhh!!!  you people are so grim you make me want to kill myself!  <br/> <br/></td>', 'no more suicides!!!  aghhh!!!  you people are so grim you make me want to kill myself!   ', '2003-02-26 03:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(224668, 12901, 6171, '<td valign="top">This board position is impossible.  Black always moves first.</td>', 'This board position is impossible.  Black always moves first.', '2003-02-26 04:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(224674, 12782, 5628, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, not much despair in there though......</td>', 'Nice photo, not much despair in there though......', '2003-02-26 05:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(224676, 12816, 5628, '<td valign="top">Very nice flower shot. I''m curious though, how does this show DESPAIR?</td>', 'Very nice flower shot. I''m curious though, how does this show DESPAIR?', '2003-02-26 06:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(224678, 13031, 5628, '<td valign="top">Burt Reynolds said it best: '''' I''ve been poor and unhappy and rich and unhappy, but I like being rich and unhappy a hell of a lot more. '''' Interesting shot!</td>', 'Burt Reynolds said it best: '''' I''ve been poor and unhappy and rich and unhappy, but I like being rich and unhappy a hell of a lot more. '''' Interesting shot!', '2003-02-26 06:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(224680, 12895, 888, '<td valign="top">no news is good news!</td>', 'no news is good news!', '2003-02-26 07:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(224681, 12797, 888, '<td valign="top">funny but I don''t see how its despair.</td>', 'funny but I don''t see how its despair.', '2003-02-26 07:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(224682, 13102, 888, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful cat.  it looks quite contented so it doesn''t really say despair to me</td>', 'what a beautiful cat.  it looks quite contented so it doesn''t really say despair to me', '2003-02-26 07:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(224683, 13029, 888, '<td valign="top">interesting but I don''t think the colour and graininess does it any favours</td>', 'interesting but I don''t think the colour and graininess does it any favours', '2003-02-26 07:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(224684, 12817, 888, '<td valign="top">boy do I know that feeling</td>', 'boy do I know that feeling', '2003-02-26 07:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(224685, 13083, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I find the contrast a little high, though.</td>', 'Nice composition. I find the contrast a little high, though.', '2003-02-26 07:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(224686, 13056, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Good portrayal of despair. The focus is a little too soft (IMO) but works for the theme. The contrast is too high (IMO) as the snow from the bench just blends into the background snow. Nonetheless, good job.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Good portrayal of despair. The focus is a little too soft (IMO) but works for the theme. The contrast is too high (IMO) as the snow from the bench just blends into the background snow. Nonetheless, good job.', '2003-02-26 07:46:58.000000', NULL, 1);
