(224690, 13034, 5176, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge very well I think it would have had more impact if the model wasn''t dressed in red 8</td>', 'meets the challenge very well I think it would have had more impact if the model wasn''t dressed in red 8', '2003-02-26 07:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(224691, 12856, 5044, '<td valign="top">That''s very funny...</td>', 'That''s very funny...', '2003-02-26 07:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(224692, 13040, 5176, '<td valign="top">Outstanding picture unlike anything else entered it really conveys the message should be a "how to do this" 10</td>', 'Outstanding picture unlike anything else entered it really conveys the message should be a "how to do this" 10', '2003-02-26 07:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(224694, 12782, 5044, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot! I love the composition and colours. Did you post process it much? Desaturation of all but green perhaps? I don''t find it really fits the topic, though. Too bad. It would have been a 10.</td>', 'GREAT shot! I love the composition and colours. Did you post process it much? Desaturation of all but green perhaps? I don''t find it really fits the topic, though. Too bad. It would have been a 10.', '2003-02-26 08:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(224718, 13094, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIce point of view. Lighting works well to help with framing here.</td>', 'NIce point of view. Lighting works well to help with framing here.', '2003-02-26 09:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(224719, 12891, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice lines the draw the eye, and good tones.</td>', 'Nice lines the draw the eye, and good tones.', '2003-02-26 09:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(224724, 12898, 2337, '<td valign="top">Without thinking, I almost commented on the cluttered background :) <br/> <br/>This photo really suffers from the size.  It can be 640 pixels on any edge and you really should consider staying close to that. If you''re not sure how to do this, email me with the type of software you use and I''ll try to help you out.</td>', 'Without thinking, I almost commented on the cluttered background :)  This photo really suffers from the size.  It can be 640 pixels on any edge and you really should consider staying close to that. If you''re not sure how to do this, email me with the type of software you use and I''ll try to help you out.', '2003-02-26 09:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(224726, 12793, 6651, '<td valign="top">This may have had more impact in b/w or sepia</td>', 'This may have had more impact in b/w or sepia', '2003-02-26 09:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(224730, 12975, 6651, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what the pills are or what the note says, so the message could be anything.</td>', 'Can''t tell what the pills are or what the note says, so the message could be anything.', '2003-02-26 09:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(224731, 13009, 2337, '<td valign="top">Powerful interputation, well executed.  The grain works well to add to the emotion of despair.  Right now I (and most of us) are thinking about leading lines... If the arn had been positioned so the countertop edge pointed to the same spot as the needle, it may have made an even stronger image.  As it is, it''s still <b>VERY</b> powerful.</td>', 'Powerful interputation, well executed.  The grain works well to add to the emotion of despair.  Right now I (and most of us) are thinking about leading lines... If the arn had been positioned so the countertop edge pointed to the same spot as the needle, it may have made an even stronger image.  As it is, it''s still VERY powerful.', '2003-02-26 09:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(224732, 13085, 6651, '<td valign="top">The fluffy, colorful animals are a distraction</td>', 'The fluffy, colorful animals are a distraction', '2003-02-26 09:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(224733, 12776, 5391, '<td valign="top">After voting on all of the shots in the challenge, I''m coming back and changing my vote on this one to a 10.  One of my two favorites, and possibly the best in the entire category from a fine art perspective.  This could hang in a museum.  The placement of the hands and they character that they portray, without showing any semblance of a face, is just phenomenal.  Another thing that contributes is the simple color scheme.  The color in the shirt is matched perfectly by the cane.  Composition is so strong dynamically, and I can''t get over how much this says, in a quiet manner.  This shot is a rare work and will be added to my favorites.</td>', 'After voting on all of the shots in the challenge, I''m coming back and changing my vote on this one to a 10.  One of my two favorites, and possibly the best in the entire category from a fine art perspective.  This could hang in a museum.  The placement of the hands and they character that they portray, without showing any semblance of a face, is just phenomenal.  Another thing that contributes is the simple color scheme.  The color in the shirt is matched perfectly by the cane.  Composition is so strong dynamically, and I can''t get over how much this says, in a quiet manner.  This shot is a rare work and will be added to my favorites.', '2003-02-26 09:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(224734, 12874, 5391, '<td valign="top">Totally awesome shot.  Meets the challenge perfectly PLUS has the "wow" factor.  Great composition and I love the tones.  The little white spots in the shoe really make the whole thing "pop" - and it''s echo by the boat below gives a great feeling of depth.  10</td>', 'Totally awesome shot.  Meets the challenge perfectly PLUS has the "wow" factor.  Great composition and I love the tones.  The little white spots in the shoe really make the whole thing "pop" - and it''s echo by the boat below gives a great feeling of depth.  10', '2003-02-26 09:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(224735, 12779, 5391, '<td valign="top">Being a dog lover, I''m particularly fond of this image.  It''s well executed and fits the challenge well without being morbidly depressing.  Excellent sharpness on the treats and creative use of dof with the dog.  I hope the puppy got to eat the props when  you were done...  9<br/> <br/>2/26 - Had to come back and change this to a 10...  One of my three favorties this week.</td>', 'Being a dog lover, I''m particularly fond of this image.  It''s well executed and fits the challenge well without being morbidly depressing.  Excellent sharpness on the treats and creative use of dof with the dog.  I hope the puppy got to eat the props when  you were done...  9 2/26 - Had to come back and change this to a 10...  One of my three favorties this week.', '2003-02-26 09:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(224740, 13039, 772, '<td valign="top">This landmark is a site of a lot of despair... great idea for a photo for this challenge :) - setzler</td>', 'This landmark is a site of a lot of despair... great idea for a photo for this challenge :) - setzler', '2003-02-26 10:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(224741, 13055, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo... the brick wall really makes this work for me... maybe it represents a barrier that is impossible to overcome... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an excellent photo... the brick wall really makes this work for me... maybe it represents a barrier that is impossible to overcome... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-02-26 10:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(224743, 12864, 772, '<td valign="top">very interesting photo... I believe that the eyes alone may not be quite enough to really convey your ''despair'' in this shot.  There is a sense of deep thought here, but maybe including some more of the face would better relay despair... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'very interesting photo... I believe that the eyes alone may not be quite enough to really convey your ''despair'' in this shot.  There is a sense of deep thought here, but maybe including some more of the face would better relay despair... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-02-26 10:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(224744, 13047, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting use of lighting in this shot... i think it would be even stronger with some more light from the camera angle as well... the hair highlight is excellent :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting use of lighting in this shot... i think it would be even stronger with some more light from the camera angle as well... the hair highlight is excellent :) - setzler', '2003-02-26 10:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
