(224980, 13044, 6182, '<td valign="top">Very funny...I can totally relate to this exact feeling...I love it!   My husband wanted to do something similar for the challenge but couldn''t come up with a shot that he liked enough to pull it off.     The only thing that I think would have added to this would be maybe one square on the roll...just for texture!</td>', 'Very funny...I can totally relate to this exact feeling...I love it!   My husband wanted to do something similar for the challenge but couldn''t come up with a shot that he liked enough to pull it off.     The only thing that I think would have added to this would be maybe one square on the roll...just for texture!', '2003-02-26 22:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
