(224982, 12886, 4494, '<td valign="top">Oh man now this one is good... Finally.  The only thing that takes away is the bright sun in the front-right.  But that would be hard to avoid.  Good one!!!  First and only 9.</td>', 'Oh man now this one is good... Finally.  The only thing that takes away is the bright sun in the front-right.  But that would be hard to avoid.  Good one!!!  First and only 9.', '2003-02-26 22:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
