(224990, 12901, 6182, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat idea but this game is completely impossible and that bothers me...sorry.</td>', 'This is a really neat idea but this game is completely impossible and that bothers me...sorry.', '2003-02-26 22:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(224991, 12813, 4494, '<td valign="top">What does this have to do with Despair!!  If it said "NO Work" I''d understand.</td>', 'What does this have to do with Despair!!  If it said "NO Work" I''d understand.', '2003-02-26 22:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(224992, 12770, 6182, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to realize that this was a car even though we are living in Virginia and experienced this same thing. This is a beautiful shot...I love the form and texture and light and negative space...very nice!</td>', 'It took me a while to realize that this was a car even though we are living in Virginia and experienced this same thing. This is a beautiful shot...I love the form and texture and light and negative space...very nice!', '2003-02-26 22:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(224993, 12917, 4494, '<td valign="top">Condolences....  Very nice picture and lighting.  8.  My wife''s mom just died recently and I thought about doing this same kind of thing but decided not to.</td>', 'Condolences....  Very nice picture and lighting.  8.  My wife''s mom just died recently and I thought about doing this same kind of thing but decided not to.', '2003-02-26 22:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(224995, 12929, 6182, '<td valign="top">I like the picture and I thought about taking photos of buildings in disrepair but  clearly this building has not been inhabited in quite some time and to me it''s just a building in disrepair...that is considerably different than despair which is a human emotion.   In order to have despair in this photo I think you need to have a human and have that human attempting to inhabit this place.   Just my opinion!</td>', 'I like the picture and I thought about taking photos of buildings in disrepair but  clearly this building has not been inhabited in quite some time and to me it''s just a building in disrepair...that is considerably different than despair which is a human emotion.   In order to have despair in this photo I think you need to have a human and have that human attempting to inhabit this place.   Just my opinion!', '2003-02-26 22:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(224996, 13011, 6182, '<td valign="top">Way past needing water!!!...Need trashcan to pick up the pieces!</td>', 'Way past needing water!!!...Need trashcan to pick up the pieces!', '2003-02-26 22:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
