(225029, 13004, 4494, '<td valign="top">What a COOL PICTURE!!  I love it!  But it doesn''t really convey despair.</td>', 'What a COOL PICTURE!!  I love it!  But it doesn''t really convey despair.', '2003-02-26 22:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
