(225123, 12973, 6172, '<td valign="top">You are very pretty, so what''s to despair?  Is it because you must cover yourself in such a strict fashion?  Please explain, I can still change my vote.</td>', 'You are very pretty, so what''s to despair?  Is it because you must cover yourself in such a strict fashion?  Please explain, I can still change my vote.', '2003-02-27 02:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(225124, 12870, 6172, '<td valign="top">I try to get despair from this picture, but I have a hard time.  I''m sure you mean that the person sitting there must be in some despair.  The whole picture is so overwhelmed by the beautiful architecture of the church,  the message is weak.</td>', 'I try to get despair from this picture, but I have a hard time.  I''m sure you mean that the person sitting there must be in some despair.  The whole picture is so overwhelmed by the beautiful architecture of the church,  the message is weak.', '2003-02-27 02:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(225136, 12919, 1829, '<td valign="top">A very well composed photograph.  The b&amp;w works realy well here.  I feel in your image a sense of despair because of the way the person is coming across.  Fear, scared, anxious.  An excellent emotional photo with a lot of character behind it.  Excellent job and well executed.  GL.</td>', 'A very well composed photograph.  The b&w works realy well here.  I feel in your image a sense of despair because of the way the person is coming across.  Fear, scared, anxious.  An excellent emotional photo with a lot of character behind it.  Excellent job and well executed.  GL.', '2003-02-27 05:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(225137, 13051, 1829, '<td valign="top">Now this is brilliant photography.  The way the model is holding the noose is really expressing himself about the way he is feeling at this moment.  Although I wish upon nobody to seriously take it upon themselves to carry out this proceedure and I understand that this is staged (but very very well).  Your photo carries a lot of emotion and despair.  I wish you the best in this challenge. 10 :)</td>', 'Now this is brilliant photography.  The way the model is holding the noose is really expressing himself about the way he is feeling at this moment.  Although I wish upon nobody to seriously take it upon themselves to carry out this proceedure and I understand that this is staged (but very very well).  Your photo carries a lot of emotion and despair.  I wish you the best in this challenge. 10 :)', '2003-02-27 05:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(225138, 12852, 1829, '<td valign="top">Oh dear....somebody''s gonna be a little upset when they see this.  Ouch.  Anyway, it certainly is a great capture and the lighting and clarity is great as well.  Good luck.</td>', 'Oh dear....somebody''s gonna be a little upset when they see this.  Ouch.  Anyway, it certainly is a great capture and the lighting and clarity is great as well.  Good luck.', '2003-02-27 05:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(225139, 12800, 1829, '<td valign="top">Ohhh I''ve never seen one of these DQ''s before.  The image overall is brilliant in the fact that it tells me emotion and how you felt about this situation.  Clarity and lighting are great too.  Excellent work.  Gl.</td>', 'Ohhh I''ve never seen one of these DQ''s before.  The image overall is brilliant in the fact that it tells me emotion and how you felt about this situation.  Clarity and lighting are great too.  Excellent work.  Gl.', '2003-02-27 05:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(225140, 12770, 1829, '<td valign="top">I''m really unsure what this picture is, however I see wonderful texture, awesome lighting technique, great composition as well.   Nicely executed.  GL.</td>', 'I''m really unsure what this picture is, however I see wonderful texture, awesome lighting technique, great composition as well.   Nicely executed.  GL.', '2003-02-27 05:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(225141, 13058, 1829, '<td valign="top">LOL Love the title.  Umm yes you have captured ''one of those moments''  you can tell by all the people rushing and the look on that ladies face.  She''s certainly not enjoying it at all.  An excellent photograph of feeling and emotion.  Excellent job and GL.</td>', 'LOL Love the title.  Umm yes you have captured ''one of those moments''  you can tell by all the people rushing and the look on that ladies face.  She''s certainly not enjoying it at all.  An excellent photograph of feeling and emotion.  Excellent job and GL.', '2003-02-27 05:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(225148, 12815, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great shot, you have managed to create a cool effect of the reflection on the floor. It looks as if there is water on the floor and the reflection is swimming. Good job! Without all that foreground this image wouldn''t have the same impact.</td>', 'Great shot, you have managed to create a cool effect of the reflection on the floor. It looks as if there is water on the floor and the reflection is swimming. Good job! Without all that foreground this image wouldn''t have the same impact.', '2003-02-27 06:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(225150, 12962, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely sepia toning and great crop here. This photo tells me a whole story, it is despair pure.</td>', 'Lovely sepia toning and great crop here. This photo tells me a whole story, it is despair pure.', '2003-02-27 06:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(225151, 12871, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is despair for sure, poor little kitty, you can read it in its eyes so clearly. It seems a tad out of focus though but maybe that was increased by saving for the web.</td>', 'This is despair for sure, poor little kitty, you can read it in its eyes so clearly. It seems a tad out of focus though but maybe that was increased by saving for the web.', '2003-02-27 06:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(225152, 12814, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Did you ask him to do that? Love the colours here, and you managed to freeze the surfer in mid air which isn''t all that easy I know. Bringing in all that foreground has really increased the impact in this image, choice!</td>', 'Great capture! Did you ask him to do that? Love the colours here, and you managed to freeze the surfer in mid air which isn''t all that easy I know. Bringing in all that foreground has really increased the impact in this image, choice!', '2003-02-27 06:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(225156, 12831, 5728, '<td valign="top">This one has nearly got me going for my handkerchief. You''ve made that despair look so real. Shame I can''t see her eyes though, eyes really show true despair. But going by your title she is hiding so you''ve justified that. It''s a nice tight crop which isn''t negative at all in this image, in fact it enhances it a lot more. Choice.</td>', 'This one has nearly got me going for my handkerchief. You''ve made that despair look so real. Shame I can''t see her eyes though, eyes really show true despair. But going by your title she is hiding so you''ve justified that. It''s a nice tight crop which isn''t negative at all in this image, in fact it enhances it a lot more. Choice.', '2003-02-27 07:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(225157, 12950, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great shot here. So simple but so much impact. I love the pastel kind of colours you got in this photo. The way you have cropped this photo in a long portrait style really does it justice. Maybe it would have been better to have some writing on the paper though, it looks as if nothing is written on it.</td>', 'Great shot here. So simple but so much impact. I love the pastel kind of colours you got in this photo. The way you have cropped this photo in a long portrait style really does it justice. Maybe it would have been better to have some writing on the paper though, it looks as if nothing is written on it.', '2003-02-27 07:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(225158, 12879, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and not too harsh at all. Somehow some of the toes seem a little squared or they give the impression they are cut off, kind of as if this person has been extracted and placed on a black background. This is a very good depiction of despair, pat yourself on the back :-)</td>', 'Nice lighting and not too harsh at all. Somehow some of the toes seem a little squared or they give the impression they are cut off, kind of as if this person has been extracted and placed on a black background. This is a very good depiction of despair, pat yourself on the back :-)', '2003-02-27 07:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(225159, 12905, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent effect here and the expression on the subject''s (your?) face is great. However it somehow looks more like an expression of annoyance more than despair. Good one!</td>', 'Excellent effect here and the expression on the subject''s (your?) face is great. However it somehow looks more like an expression of annoyance more than despair. Good one!', '2003-02-27 07:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
