(225311, 13094, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice shot, fulll on "despair" target. The lighting is amazing here, you really set this up well. The way the whole image has a frame of darkness around it with the light coming from above gives it that special quality. Congratulations in an excellent photo.</td>', 'Choice shot, fulll on "despair" target. The lighting is amazing here, you really set this up well. The way the whole image has a frame of darkness around it with the light coming from above gives it that special quality. Congratulations in an excellent photo.', '2003-02-27 11:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(225312, 13104, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice one. In a way it reminds me of one of those old James Dean photos. You did it well. I am not sure that it being too dark is a negative point actually. I like it that way.</td>', 'Nice one. In a way it reminds me of one of those old James Dean photos. You did it well. I am not sure that it being too dark is a negative point actually. I like it that way.', '2003-02-27 11:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(225322, 13051, 772, '<td valign="top">i think this is an excellent composition and I like the darkness of it, but i think the subject could use a little more light and still maintain the dark theme.... nice shot :) - setzler</td>', 'i think this is an excellent composition and I like the darkness of it, but i think the subject could use a little more light and still maintain the dark theme.... nice shot :) - setzler', '2003-02-27 11:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(225324, 13104, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot.. I love the contrast in this image.. great work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot.. I love the contrast in this image.. great work :) - setzler', '2003-02-27 11:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(225325, 12986, 772, '<td valign="top">nice shot!  I love the black and white choice on this one... great composition as well... - setzler</td>', 'nice shot!  I love the black and white choice on this one... great composition as well... - setzler', '2003-02-27 11:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(225328, 12829, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost put this at the top, but I''m not sure I like it in b&amp;w: would love to see a colour version - maybe the ground would look drier? It also for me, doesn''t quite say ''despair'', as in no hope at all - still looks pretty much like a boat, huh?</td>', 'Almost put this at the top, but I''m not sure I like it in b&w: would love to see a colour version - maybe the ground would look drier? It also for me, doesn''t quite say ''despair'', as in no hope at all - still looks pretty much like a boat, huh?', '2003-02-27 12:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(225329, 13116, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the compostition, like the colour, like the dirtiness of subject against the cleanness of the light - I just find it too literal an interpretation.</td>', 'Like the compostition, like the colour, like the dirtiness of subject against the cleanness of the light - I just find it too literal an interpretation.', '2003-02-27 12:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(225331, 12946, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice texture on the pillars - but it looks like trees in the back to me, however much colour''s been taken out. Bit cheeky?</td>', 'Nice composition, nice texture on the pillars - but it looks like trees in the back to me, however much colour''s been taken out. Bit cheeky?', '2003-02-27 12:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(225332, 12974, 6999, '<td valign="top">Made me smile - can''t quite go for it because of the flash shadow though. Like the intensity of the contrast level though.</td>', 'Made me smile - can''t quite go for it because of the flash shadow though. Like the intensity of the contrast level though.', '2003-02-27 12:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
