(225635, 13012, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well, as his arms don''t really move, I say he was lynched rather than suicide!  Someone even faked his suicide note!  Seriously, good focus and color.  Background is a touch busy, you might want to consider changing your lighting sceme.  Challenge met, by a bear''s nose!  5 Swash</td>', 'Well, as his arms don''t really move, I say he was lynched rather than suicide!  Someone even faked his suicide note!  Seriously, good focus and color.  Background is a touch busy, you might want to consider changing your lighting sceme.  Challenge met, by a bear''s nose!  5 Swash', '2003-02-27 19:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(225638, 13124, 1005, '<td valign="top">Title - first question - What am I and what am I doing?  I see a part of a thumb, but the rest is indistinguishable.  I''ll try to remember to read the description after the challenge, provided there is one.  3 Swash</td>', 'Title - first question - What am I and what am I doing?  I see a part of a thumb, but the rest is indistinguishable.  I''ll try to remember to read the description after the challenge, provided there is one.  3 Swash', '2003-02-27 19:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(225641, 12910, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ehhhh, please turn off the date/time stamp, it''s distracting and doesn''t help the image.  As for the challenge, no, not much there to the average person.  The paper boy shouldn''t get a tip this Christmas, but otherwise ....... 4 Swash</td>', 'Ehhhh, please turn off the date/time stamp, it''s distracting and doesn''t help the image.  As for the challenge, no, not much there to the average person.  The paper boy shouldn''t get a tip this Christmas, but otherwise ....... 4 Swash', '2003-02-27 19:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
