(225675, 13020, 6100, '<td valign="top">Your title is interesting. I immediately thought of an older woman who is no longer able to see or to hold a thread and needle still long enough to get the two together or even to hold the needle steady enough to sew. Either image --- my first thoughts or those suggested by your title --- are items of despair to me. You''ve met the challenge very well here and the selective focus is quite nice.</td>', 'Your title is interesting. I immediately thought of an older woman who is no longer able to see or to hold a thread and needle still long enough to get the two together or even to hold the needle steady enough to sew. Either image --- my first thoughts or those suggested by your title --- are items of despair to me. You''ve met the challenge very well here and the selective focus is quite nice.', '2003-02-27 21:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(225677, 12910, 6100, '<td valign="top">Gee, I''ve seen this same image in person several times recently. You''ve captured a funny view of despair!</td>', 'Gee, I''ve seen this same image in person several times recently. You''ve captured a funny view of despair!', '2003-02-27 21:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
