(225685, 13058, 1707, '<td valign="top">A timeless frustration for all of us!  A good choice.  I like your composition with the couple of the left and the board on the right.  I wonder if a little more brightness could help out.</td>', 'A timeless frustration for all of us!  A good choice.  I like your composition with the couple of the left and the board on the right.  I wonder if a little more brightness could help out.', '2003-02-27 21:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
