(225692, 12870, 1707, '<td valign="top">A beautiful church!  The photo is a bit dark in some spots and a little more brightness would do it justice.  Perhaps you may want to study how the light enters the church throughtout the day.  A different time frame may give you a better photo</td>', 'A beautiful church!  The photo is a bit dark in some spots and a little more brightness would do it justice.  Perhaps you may want to study how the light enters the church throughtout the day.  A different time frame may give you a better photo', '2003-02-27 21:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
