(225732, 12973, 1707, '<td valign="top">beautiful lady but she doesn''t look in despair.  The "times" will not always be the same so you can not expect everyone to relate and react to this photo.  It may not represent the same thing to you as to someone else.  The topic is despair and I can''t give this good photo a high score.</td>', 'beautiful lady but she doesn''t look in despair.  The "times" will not always be the same so you can not expect everyone to relate and react to this photo.  It may not represent the same thing to you as to someone else.  The topic is despair and I can''t give this good photo a high score.', '2003-02-27 22:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
