(225784, 12775, 7015, '<td valign="top">nice composition. it begs the question, what happened here. it looks like you''ve got some glass reflection or something like that in your sky??? otherwise it''s a pretty technically sound image. I suppose it could be a cloud but it looks fairly mechanical. I''m not sure what the rules are but I''d burn in the highlights there to give some more contrast in the sky if in fact that is a cloud. It could give you a nice added layer to the pic.</td>', 'nice composition. it begs the question, what happened here. it looks like you''ve got some glass reflection or something like that in your sky??? otherwise it''s a pretty technically sound image. I suppose it could be a cloud but it looks fairly mechanical. I''m not sure what the rules are but I''d burn in the highlights there to give some more contrast in the sky if in fact that is a cloud. It could give you a nice added layer to the pic.', '2003-02-28 00:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(225785, 13111, 7015, '<td valign="top">great compostion, but bad moire pattern. It doesn''t hurt it as a photo but it is an image for presentation. Nice job. Where''s this at? I''m a big fan of abandoned places.</td>', 'great compostion, but bad moire pattern. It doesn''t hurt it as a photo but it is an image for presentation. Nice job. Where''s this at? I''m a big fan of abandoned places.', '2003-02-28 00:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
