(225976, 12874, 1005, '<td valign="top">Moving and well taken.  Framing around the photo seems a little excessive.  Coloration - doesn''t do anything for me.  On a less serious note:  unless you''re planning on landing on a boat, I think you need more altitude to ensure it''s more than just an attempt at suicide.  6 Swash</td>', 'Moving and well taken.  Framing around the photo seems a little excessive.  Coloration - doesn''t do anything for me.  On a less serious note:  unless you''re planning on landing on a boat, I think you need more altitude to ensure it''s more than just an attempt at suicide.  6 Swash', '2003-02-28 12:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
