(225989, 12992, 4340, '<td valign="top">such a sad pic, but very good portrayal of despair.  even not seeing the person''s face, but the reactions of others to this person makes you know what it is like</td>', 'such a sad pic, but very good portrayal of despair.  even not seeing the person''s face, but the reactions of others to this person makes you know what it is like', '2003-02-28 13:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(225992, 12946, 5865, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph.  It is certainly is a good example of how to frame the subject.  The texture found on the columns adds something and the line of the stairs and sloping pavement is also interesting.  The man is in shadow to a certain extent, but I think it adds to the atmosphere.  One problem is I did not really undersand the title and wondered if the photograph really did exhibit despair.  The man looks to be at complete peace.<br/> <br/>Very nice photograph though.</td>', 'I really like this photograph.  It is certainly is a good example of how to frame the subject.  The texture found on the columns adds something and the line of the stairs and sloping pavement is also interesting.  The man is in shadow to a certain extent, but I think it adds to the atmosphere.  One problem is I did not really undersand the title and wondered if the photograph really did exhibit despair.  The man looks to be at complete peace. Very nice photograph though.', '2003-02-28 13:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(225994, 12889, 5865, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea behind this photograph.  It portrays such a common feeling of despair that I think most people could identify with it.  It''s a nice photograph too.  The lighting in the side-mirror is very interesting.  I am wondering if the mirror ought to be bigger in the frame as the background seems a bit dull and unappealing.  It is a good idea though.</td>', 'I liked the idea behind this photograph.  It portrays such a common feeling of despair that I think most people could identify with it.  It''s a nice photograph too.  The lighting in the side-mirror is very interesting.  I am wondering if the mirror ought to be bigger in the frame as the background seems a bit dull and unappealing.  It is a good idea though.', '2003-02-28 13:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(225996, 12962, 5865, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a very powerful photograph.  The image it conveys is powerfully presented.  The composition is great as a lot of the elements have been placed on the thirds.  The railings behind the man add to the despair of the tramp as it makes him look like he is behind bars.  I think it was a right choice to use black and white, colour would have been inappropriate.  In short, I liked it.</td>', 'I think that this is a very powerful photograph.  The image it conveys is powerfully presented.  The composition is great as a lot of the elements have been placed on the thirds.  The railings behind the man add to the despair of the tramp as it makes him look like he is behind bars.  I think it was a right choice to use black and white, colour would have been inappropriate.  In short, I liked it.', '2003-02-28 13:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(225997, 13065, 5865, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait.  The lighting looks excellent to my untrained eye, with highlights at just the right places.  The watery eyes are highlighted making it look as though the girl is tearful.  I like the highlight on the lips and hair too.  Also the model looks good with a nice-shaped face and the freckles are unusual and add to the interest of the shot overall.<br/> <br/>Lovely photograph.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait.  The lighting looks excellent to my untrained eye, with highlights at just the right places.  The watery eyes are highlighted making it look as though the girl is tearful.  I like the highlight on the lips and hair too.  Also the model looks good with a nice-shaped face and the freckles are unusual and add to the interest of the shot overall. Lovely photograph.', '2003-02-28 14:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(225998, 13044, 6530, '<td valign="top">always happens at the worst times</td>', 'always happens at the worst times', '2003-02-28 14:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(226001, 12887, 1379, '<td valign="top">Terribly sad photo, in my top 3 this week.  His posture and overall disheveled appearance speak volumes.  Especially poignant is the rip in his shirt under the arm.  Your photo makes me thankful for so many things.</td>', 'Terribly sad photo, in my top 3 this week.  His posture and overall disheveled appearance speak volumes.  Especially poignant is the rip in his shirt under the arm.  Your photo makes me thankful for so many things.', '2003-02-28 14:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(226002, 12782, 1379, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this, and can''t wait to add it to my favorites.  That green is so intense and vivid against the dark of the trees, it''s fantastic.  It honestly does not really convey a sense of despair to me, but it''s awesome in it''s own right.</td>', 'I absolutely love this, and can''t wait to add it to my favorites.  That green is so intense and vivid against the dark of the trees, it''s fantastic.  It honestly does not really convey a sense of despair to me, but it''s awesome in it''s own right.', '2003-02-28 14:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(226003, 12886, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wrenching as hell.  Tears are coming as I study your photo.  Perfect depiction of despair.</td>', 'Wrenching as hell.  Tears are coming as I study your photo.  Perfect depiction of despair.', '2003-02-28 14:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(226005, 12986, 1379, '<td valign="top">Terribly sad.  I love the cropping you chose, focusing on this defeated, achingly depressed eye.  Zoos are so fun and entertaining, aren''t they?</td>', 'Terribly sad.  I love the cropping you chose, focusing on this defeated, achingly depressed eye.  Zoos are so fun and entertaining, aren''t they?', '2003-02-28 14:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
