(226008, 13029, 2130, '<td valign="top">the grain and sepia make this look soooo old and special, I love it, surely a 10</td>', 'the grain and sepia make this look soooo old and special, I love it, surely a 10', '2003-02-28 14:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(226009, 13027, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very desperate.  I like the slightly fuzzy focus and the bland color of the carpet.  The nudity of your model adds to the darkness of the emotion.  Give this guy a hug.</td>', 'Very desperate.  I like the slightly fuzzy focus and the bland color of the carpet.  The nudity of your model adds to the darkness of the emotion.  Give this guy a hug.', '2003-02-28 14:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(226011, 13034, 2130, '<td valign="top">strong photo!!! very well done, congrats...surely a 10</td>', 'strong photo!!! very well done, congrats...surely a 10', '2003-02-28 14:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(226012, 13034, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow, incredible and provocative.  Vomit, blood, ???  Horrifying either way.  I love how this is so open ended and terrible.  Has she been beaten?  Committing suicide?  Horrible illness?  The contrast of the stark room and her vivid emission and her outfit is really intense.  Very disturbing and powerful.</td>', 'Wow, incredible and provocative.  Vomit, blood, ???  Horrifying either way.  I love how this is so open ended and terrible.  Has she been beaten?  Committing suicide?  Horrible illness?  The contrast of the stark room and her vivid emission and her outfit is really intense.  Very disturbing and powerful.', '2003-02-28 14:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(226013, 12911, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a serious, wrinkly little guy!  His squeezed eyes and pursed mouth really speak of despair.  I hope that''s just his normal expression for now, and not an indicator of actual trouble.  Intense photo.  The tight cropping really enhances it all.</td>', 'Wow!  What a serious, wrinkly little guy!  His squeezed eyes and pursed mouth really speak of despair.  I hope that''s just his normal expression for now, and not an indicator of actual trouble.  Intense photo.  The tight cropping really enhances it all.', '2003-02-28 14:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(226015, 12815, 1379, '<td valign="top">Somehow those empty wire hangers make this shot even better for me.  Awesome positioning of your model, and the light is perfect.  Very depressing to look at.  You hit the target!</td>', 'Somehow those empty wire hangers make this shot even better for me.  Awesome positioning of your model, and the light is perfect.  Very depressing to look at.  You hit the target!', '2003-02-28 14:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(226017, 12966, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this image is such a small portion of the frame that I cannot see any details.  I think this is a child in a corner, but that''s just a guess.  Was there some deeper meaning to the huge open frame?  3 Swash</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this image is such a small portion of the frame that I cannot see any details.  I think this is a child in a corner, but that''s just a guess.  Was there some deeper meaning to the huge open frame?  3 Swash', '2003-02-28 14:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(226018, 12895, 1005, '<td valign="top">While this is a fairly well taken photo, I am not seeing a whole lot of dispair.  I''m sure some of these boxes contain newspapers, but the one I can make out is an rental or house sale advertisement.    4 Swash</td>', 'While this is a fairly well taken photo, I am not seeing a whole lot of dispair.  I''m sure some of these boxes contain newspapers, but the one I can make out is an rental or house sale advertisement.    4 Swash', '2003-02-28 14:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(226019, 12917, 1005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful arrangement, well taken photo, good focus and color.  Framing - cropped the arrangement a little close, but probably to cut out other things.  This pulls at my heart strings since my father died just before Christmas.  It still hurts.  Looks like a bit of a nasty stain next to the urn.  9 Swash</td>', 'Beautiful arrangement, well taken photo, good focus and color.  Framing - cropped the arrangement a little close, but probably to cut out other things.  This pulls at my heart strings since my father died just before Christmas.  It still hurts.  Looks like a bit of a nasty stain next to the urn.  9 Swash', '2003-02-28 14:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(226020, 12797, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very bad pun.  I, too, did a somewhat "fun" version of dispair, I hope you are fairing better than me, but I doubt it.  White on white seems diffucult as the edges don''t seem very clear.  4 Swash</td>', 'Very bad pun.  I, too, did a somewhat "fun" version of dispair, I hope you are fairing better than me, but I doubt it.  White on white seems diffucult as the edges don''t seem very clear.  4 Swash', '2003-02-28 14:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
