(226022, 12845, 1005, '<td valign="top">Focus seems good, difficult lighting with both shade and bright sunlight, bear seems a bit washed out in the sun.  Challenge aspect - moderate to weak, sorry. 4 Swash</td>', 'Focus seems good, difficult lighting with both shade and bright sunlight, bear seems a bit washed out in the sun.  Challenge aspect - moderate to weak, sorry. 4 Swash', '2003-02-28 15:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(226023, 12841, 1005, '<td valign="top">Focus seems very sharp, cropping - cutting off part of the subject is probably not a good thing, esp. with all the open space at the other end.  Being a non-christian person, this image does not offer me any dispair type feelings, but I would think this more lends itself to hope than dispair.  4 Swash</td>', 'Focus seems very sharp, cropping - cutting off part of the subject is probably not a good thing, esp. with all the open space at the other end.  Being a non-christian person, this image does not offer me any dispair type feelings, but I would think this more lends itself to hope than dispair.  4 Swash', '2003-02-28 15:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
