(226097, 12805, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very stormy sky there, I particularly like this photo because of the way you put those branches in to the left there. It really puts a lot of power into this image especially with those few leaves hanging in the middle. Very despairing indeed, good composition.</td>', 'Very stormy sky there, I particularly like this photo because of the way you put those branches in to the left there. It really puts a lot of power into this image especially with those few leaves hanging in the middle. Very despairing indeed, good composition.', '2003-02-28 18:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
