(226099, 12813, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a different version of despair. I see what you meant by this. The composition is interesting. The light on the blue part above the window is a little bothersome but typical for a night shot. I can''t see your refelction in the window either so I guess you didn''t use a flash here although it is difficult to tell with those lights reflecting there. Good luck.</td>', 'This is a different version of despair. I see what you meant by this. The composition is interesting. The light on the blue part above the window is a little bothersome but typical for a night shot. I can''t see your refelction in the window either so I guess you didn''t use a flash here although it is difficult to tell with those lights reflecting there. Good luck.', '2003-02-28 19:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(226101, 12833, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really cute shot!  Very good focus and color.  Cropping works well enough.  I, too did a humorous dispair shot.  I would imagine your photo is doing about as well as mine (I didn''t expect to win or even place well, but I did have fun with it, I hope you can say the same.)  5 Swash</td>', 'Really cute shot!  Very good focus and color.  Cropping works well enough.  I, too did a humorous dispair shot.  I would imagine your photo is doing about as well as mine (I didn''t expect to win or even place well, but I did have fun with it, I hope you can say the same.)  5 Swash', '2003-02-28 19:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
