(226165, 13002, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a great image, I like the way you captured it. The rule of thirds really applies here. If it meets the challenge of "despair" I am not sure, but judging from the look in the girl''s eyes I''ll agree with you. Good one.</td>', 'This is a great image, I like the way you captured it. The rule of thirds really applies here. If it meets the challenge of "despair" I am not sure, but judging from the look in the girl''s eyes I''ll agree with you. Good one.', '2003-02-28 20:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(226168, 13107, 5728, '<td valign="top">I see what you mean here with despair, it is kind of abstract but I like it. The photo itself is excellent, Very focused, great. The only thing that bothers me is the lens flare at the top otherwise a great image.</td>', 'I see what you mean here with despair, it is kind of abstract but I like it. The photo itself is excellent, Very focused, great. The only thing that bothers me is the lens flare at the top otherwise a great image.', '2003-02-28 20:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(226169, 12768, 5728, '<td valign="top">I find it very despairing seeing animals locked up in a zoo! If only you had gone a little higher to see the despair on that tiger/lion''s eyes... The post on the left you could have cropped out a little more as well. But otherwise a good photo, good luck.</td>', 'I find it very despairing seeing animals locked up in a zoo! If only you had gone a little higher to see the despair on that tiger/lion''s eyes... The post on the left you could have cropped out a little more as well. But otherwise a good photo, good luck.', '2003-02-28 20:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(226171, 12857, 5728, '<td valign="top">Are those self inflicted wounds on his arm there? And the scar on his shoulder? That is despair! Goods shot, although it seems a little grainy to me.</td>', 'Are those self inflicted wounds on his arm there? And the scar on his shoulder? That is despair! Goods shot, although it seems a little grainy to me.', '2003-02-28 20:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(226172, 12907, 5728, '<td valign="top">I know this is a staged shot but somehow your subject''s eyes really show despair. She is a good actress, good one! The crop is very tight but in this image it works....I like it, good luck.</td>', 'I know this is a staged shot but somehow your subject''s eyes really show despair. She is a good actress, good one! The crop is very tight but in this image it works....I like it, good luck.', '2003-02-28 20:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(226173, 12896, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the negative space is good. Despair? I get your meaning here, great. Did you walk backwards again?</td>', 'Nice shot, the negative space is good. Despair? I get your meaning here, great. Did you walk backwards again?', '2003-02-28 20:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(226174, 12996, 5728, '<td valign="top">I guess it isn''t winter there right? So you must be in the southern hemisphere! Great photo you took, the composition is spot on, and the challenge you met as well. I love the texture of the water.</td>', 'I guess it isn''t winter there right? So you must be in the southern hemisphere! Great photo you took, the composition is spot on, and the challenge you met as well. I love the texture of the water.', '2003-02-28 20:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(226176, 12841, 6597, '<td valign="top">very good photography</td>', 'very good photography', '2003-02-28 21:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(226190, 12962, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Unfortunate the background could not have been better.</td>', 'Nice subject. Unfortunate the background could not have been better.', '2003-02-28 22:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(226192, 12774, 6325, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful place and a good shot. But I see no despair.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful place and a good shot. But I see no despair.', '2003-02-28 22:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(226194, 12818, 6325, '<td valign="top">Captures the challenge. I wish there was more texture - the face seems so flat.</td>', 'Captures the challenge. I wish there was more texture - the face seems so flat.', '2003-02-28 22:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(226195, 12962, 5822, '<td valign="top">This pic says it all! Boy does it ever depict despair. Great shot.</td>', 'This pic says it all! Boy does it ever depict despair. Great shot.', '2003-02-28 22:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(226197, 12996, 2700, '<td valign="top">um wow... I might be the only one that sees the art in this (grainyness, framing, black and white) but my opinion should be held as very vaild in the "real" artistic community.... AMAZING JOB... 10</td>', 'um wow... I might be the only one that sees the art in this (grainyness, framing, black and white) but my opinion should be held as very vaild in the "real" artistic community.... AMAZING JOB... 10', '2003-02-28 22:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(226198, 13042, 2700, '<td valign="top">wow this is amazing... 10 the colors are wonderful, and lighting suits the challenge/modd/everything very very well...</td>', 'wow this is amazing... 10 the colors are wonderful, and lighting suits the challenge/modd/everything very very well...', '2003-02-28 22:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(226199, 12825, 6325, '<td valign="top">A tear maybe?</td>', 'A tear maybe?', '2003-02-28 22:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(226200, 12789, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot a lot, but I think it would have had more impact had you exposed for the statue.  I think it''s a bit too dark.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot a lot, but I think it would have had more impact had you exposed for the statue.  I think it''s a bit too dark.', '2003-02-28 22:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
