(226518, 12996, 6751, '<td valign="top">This one really caught my eye. I like the textures and contrast.</td>', 'This one really caught my eye. I like the textures and contrast.', '2003-03-02 00:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(226528, 12782, 4159, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I don''t despair in looking at it, though, or think that much of anything here is.  Colors are good, though.<br/> <br/>Back later:  I have to say that, regardless of the symbolism you intended in this picture, as an uninformed viewer of that picture I would have to have had at least some clue as to your intentions.  Your picture is well-composed and has a fantasy feel to it, which I like, but I can''t relate it to the challenge without your explanation.  In the context of this contest, I think the photograph needs to speak for itself (or its photographer, as the case may be) and yours, in my opinion, doesn''t do that.</td>', 'Nice picture.  I don''t despair in looking at it, though, or think that much of anything here is.  Colors are good, though. Back later:  I have to say that, regardless of the symbolism you intended in this picture, as an uninformed viewer of that picture I would have to have had at least some clue as to your intentions.  Your picture is well-composed and has a fantasy feel to it, which I like, but I can''t relate it to the challenge without your explanation.  In the context of this contest, I think the photograph needs to speak for itself (or its photographer, as the case may be) and yours, in my opinion, doesn''t do that.', '2003-03-02 01:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(226529, 13036, 4159, '<td valign="top">Your composition has several distracting elements, I think a closer crop would have worked better.</td>', 'Your composition has several distracting elements, I think a closer crop would have worked better.', '2003-03-02 01:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(226530, 12916, 4159, '<td valign="top">I just don''t see someone about to commit suicide pouring out their pills onto their desk first.  Especially not vitamins.<br/> <br/>Candlelight burns a bit too bright here., white line distracts.</td>', 'I just don''t see someone about to commit suicide pouring out their pills onto their desk first.  Especially not vitamins. Candlelight burns a bit too bright here., white line distracts.', '2003-03-02 01:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
