(226800, 12798, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is totally a personal preference here.  I think I''d really like this better without the water drops.  To me, when the water drops are on a rose, it reminds me that the rose is fresh, and new and full of life.  The water makes it seem even more alive.  This shot, suposed to represent despair, I think should have no water drops.  I realize that water drops are added to make something interesting, so it isn''t JUST a rose, but there is no reason for this rose to have water.  it''s dead, and sad.  otherwise, the focus and clarity are great. angle and framing/cropping are excelent and the background is also good.  I like how it fades color.  Great shot. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is totally a personal preference here.  I think I''d really like this better without the water drops.  To me, when the water drops are on a rose, it reminds me that the rose is fresh, and new and full of life.  The water makes it seem even more alive.  This shot, suposed to represent despair, I think should have no water drops.  I realize that water drops are added to make something interesting, so it isn''t JUST a rose, but there is no reason for this rose to have water.  it''s dead, and sad.  otherwise, the focus and clarity are great. angle and framing/cropping are excelent and the background is also good.  I like how it fades color.  Great shot. good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-02 17:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
