(226872, 13057, 1280, '<td valign="top">The eyes are very expressive!  Sweet thing!  I can see the tongue showing and that\''s fine, but what is that other thing?  It really jumps out at me, and garners far too much attention.  Beyond DPC, this would be greatly improved by cloning that out.  <br/>Aside from that, this is very effective, and you\''ve done a wonderful job.  Your focus and exposure, and composition, including perspective are all good.</td>', 'The eyes are very expressive!  Sweet thing!  I can see the tongue showing and that\''s fine, but what is that other thing?  It really jumps out at me, and garners far too much attention.  Beyond DPC, this would be greatly improved by cloning that out.  Aside from that, this is very effective, and you\''ve done a wonderful job.  Your focus and exposure, and composition, including perspective are all good.', '2003-03-02 21:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
