(227293, 12933, 3942, '<td valign="top">By the way: Special thanks to my lovely girlfriend for bearing all the misery:<br/> <br/>"Please sit down there in the window" <br/>"Are you crazy, it''s very dirty!" <br/>"You don''t do it for me, you do it for the art :-)" <br/>"But YOU have to massage my feet later on and not the art!"<br/>"Don''t smile please, this is a despair challenge!"<br/>"grrrrr"<br/>"Can you open your jacket and pull up your knees?"<br/>"Did you forgot that it''s cold today?"<br/>"Fine, this will help you to show the perfect expression of despair :-)"<br/>"--expletive deleted--"<br/> <br/>Look up, down, tearily, outstretch one leg, pull up again,(...), and now everything again with a different aparture...<br/> <br/>Thank you Susi, this ribbon is dedicated to you ;-)!</td>', 'By the way: Special thanks to my lovely girlfriend for bearing all the misery: "Please sit down there in the window" "Are you crazy, it''s very dirty!" "You don''t do it for me, you do it for the art :-)" "But YOU have to massage my feet later on and not the art!""Don''t smile please, this is a despair challenge!""grrrrr""Can you open your jacket and pull up your knees?""Did you forgot that it''s cold today?""Fine, this will help you to show the perfect expression of despair :-)""--expletive deleted--" Look up, down, tearily, outstretch one leg, pull up again,(...), and now everything again with a different aparture... Thank you Susi, this ribbon is dedicated to you ;-)!', '2003-03-03 07:45:57.000000', NULL, 0),
