(227601, 12782, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Am I shocked at the amount of people that said they didn''t think this met the challenge.  The tree is alone, sad looking, droopy, and looking a bit unloved.  You can''t say that a haggard person is despair, but then say that a haggard tree isn''t.  I love the shot, and am adding it to my favorites. Congrats.<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'Wow.  Am I shocked at the amount of people that said they didn''t think this met the challenge.  The tree is alone, sad looking, droopy, and looking a bit unloved.  You can''t say that a haggard person is despair, but then say that a haggard tree isn''t.  I love the shot, and am adding it to my favorites. Congrats.~Heather~', '2003-03-03 12:50:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(227770, 13034, 4564, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments everyone!  I didn''t think the photo would rate that high!  But seeing that it made 4th place, it is quite stimulating to produce more. :-)  Thakns again!  <br/>PS. ;-)  Merci Mr. Dude!<br/> <br/>PPS.  Oh, and by the way, I got to give a lot of credit to my GF for accepting to pose for this pic.  It was quite hard to convince her, especially when I told her "ok, what I want you to do is put your face on the toilet, oh, and I''ll put some of your hair in the toilet too.".  Well, it costed me a nice dinner at the restaurant... but it was well worth it! LOL!   Seriously though, she did a great job.  It was not easy to stick her head so close to the toilet like that. xxx<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-03-03 18:35:35.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments everyone!  I didn''t think the photo would rate that high!  But seeing that it made 4th place, it is quite stimulating to produce more. :-)  Thakns again!  PS. ;-)  Merci Mr. Dude! PPS.  Oh, and by the way, I got to give a lot of credit to my GF for accepting to pose for this pic.  It was quite hard to convince her, especially when I told her "ok, what I want you to do is put your face on the toilet, oh, and I''ll put some of your hair in the toilet too.".  Well, it costed me a nice dinner at the restaurant... but it was well worth it! LOL!   Seriously though, she did a great job.  It was not easy to stick her head so close to the toilet like that. xxx', '2003-03-03 14:18:41.000000', '2003-03-03 18:35:35.000000', 0),
