(227997, 12916, 1280, '<td valign="top">Comments from Grayce for the Critique Club<br/>This is a good composition.  The strong diagonal forming from the paper and arm leads the eye right to the pills.  From the other direction, the pill bottle does the same thing.  Very good use of diagonals on both counts.<br/>The exposure is very good, except for the glare of the flame.  It''s over-exposed, which is a pity, because the candle isn''t even an important element to the picture. It COULD work but would need to be toned down. <br/>This is an emotional theme and you did a good job of portraying that. <br/>That little bright line up on top near the candle serves no purpose and is a distraction.  <br/>As others have mentioned, the pills definetly look like vitamins.  <br/>Overall this is an effective image, and fairly well done.  <br/>Best of luck in all your photographic endeavors.<br/>Regards,<br/> <br/>Grayce</td>', 'Comments from Grayce for the Critique ClubThis is a good composition.  The strong diagonal forming from the paper and arm leads the eye right to the pills.  From the other direction, the pill bottle does the same thing.  Very good use of diagonals on both counts.The exposure is very good, except for the glare of the flame.  It''s over-exposed, which is a pity, because the candle isn''t even an important element to the picture. It COULD work but would need to be toned down. This is an emotional theme and you did a good job of portraying that. That little bright line up on top near the candle serves no purpose and is a distraction.  As others have mentioned, the pills definetly look like vitamins.  Overall this is an effective image, and fairly well done.  Best of luck in all your photographic endeavors.Regards, Grayce', '2003-03-03 17:42:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(228031, 12939, 327, '<td valign="top"><b>CC</b> Hello to you RiderGal <br/>Fits The Challenge-Yes, IMHO is does <br/>Composition-Interesting, unique, and different. <br/>Background-n/a <br/>Digital Processing-Fair<br/>My Opinion-RiderGal this is not a bad shot, it''s way better then the comments below or the over-all score. I think what makes me like this is the 3-D feel. The focus is soft, and had it been crisp I think this shot would of been winner. I''ll bet you did this hand held. Keep shooting, generally I really like your work. You have a good eye and your shots have a good feeling.</td>', 'CC Hello to you RiderGal Fits The Challenge-Yes, IMHO is does Composition-Interesting, unique, and different. Background-n/a Digital Processing-FairMy Opinion-RiderGal this is not a bad shot, it''s way better then the comments below or the over-all score. I think what makes me like this is the 3-D feel. The focus is soft, and had it been crisp I think this shot would of been winner. I''ll bet you did this hand held. Keep shooting, generally I really like your work. You have a good eye and your shots have a good feeling.', '2003-03-03 18:17:34.000000', NULL, 0),
