(272023, 12884, 7690, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. Very despairing to think of this person, whoever they were, no one knows where, what or when. <br/>Also what is more despairing that to have only a hand printed epitath in a piece of concrete and no name.<br/>I like the graininess which matches the grains of sand in the soil. The shadow is more than perfect.<br/>I''m sorry I missed the vote. Would have given it a 10.</td>', 'I really like this photo. Very despairing to think of this person, whoever they were, no one knows where, what or when. Also what is more despairing that to have only a hand printed epitath in a piece of concrete and no name.I like the graininess which matches the grains of sand in the soil. The shadow is more than perfect.I''m sorry I missed the vote. Would have given it a 10.', '2003-04-21 05:51:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(278693, 13056, 7653, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The only thing I could suggest would be to rid the photo of the footprints in the bottom left. They detract from the simplicity of the snow. Perhaps try ''jumping'' into frame from the left next time?</td>', 'Nice shot. The only thing I could suggest would be to rid the photo of the footprints in the bottom left. They detract from the simplicity of the snow. Perhaps try ''jumping'' into frame from the left next time?', '2003-04-25 20:10:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(278781, 12857, 6059, '<td valign="top">Wow, I admire you alot for taking this shot.<br/> <br/>congrats, I like your lightning and posing. this is very emotive...<br/> <br/>v.</td>', 'Wow, I admire you alot for taking this shot. congrats, I like your lightning and posing. this is very emotive... v.', '2003-04-25 21:20:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(286426, 12966, 8056, '<td valign="top">I can''t see the reason of why posting this submission in such small and blurry. That''s why, I totally agreed why so many voters put their vote at 1 !!<br/></td>', 'I can''t see the reason of why posting this submission in such small and blurry. That''s why, I totally agreed why so many voters put their vote at 1 !!', '2003-05-03 04:04:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(286427, 12966, 7570, '<td valign="top">I think the "message" Matt was trying to convey is how the little boy got punished into the corner, and feeling so small. But then again, I''d like to see a larger image instead of this over-tiny one. I mean, this IS digital photography we are talking about here. But as an art or expression, this submission isn''t all that bad.</td>', 'I think the "message" Matt was trying to convey is how the little boy got punished into the corner, and feeling so small. But then again, I''d like to see a larger image instead of this over-tiny one. I mean, this IS digital photography we are talking about here. But as an art or expression, this submission isn''t all that bad.', '2003-05-03 04:05:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(286790, 12908, 4793, '<td valign="top">I was driving by this place today, it is now a bulldozed flat lot, no more clutter, I think I will see a big new house soon.</td>', 'I was driving by this place today, it is now a bulldozed flat lot, no more clutter, I think I will see a big new house soon.', '2003-05-04 00:32:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(309830, 12881, 714, '<td valign="top">You can tell this child was missed dearly.  You have a big heart to see the pain of others.  Great picture to show despear.</td>', 'You can tell this child was missed dearly.  You have a big heart to see the pain of others.  Great picture to show despear.', '2003-05-29 01:35:41.000000', NULL, 0),
