(331426, 12815, 8178, '<td valign="top">I know this is an old challenge, but I am new to the site. So, here is my comment now... I absolutely LOVE this shot. Stirred up a lot of emotions in me. The feeling of despair of coming home and finding all her stuff is gone! Brilliantly captured. Love the coat hangers. One critisizm, the model is little fuzzy, while the focus is one the reflection, I don''t know if this was on purpose... Great work!</td>', 'I know this is an old challenge, but I am new to the site. So, here is my comment now... I absolutely LOVE this shot. Stirred up a lot of emotions in me. The feeling of despair of coming home and finding all her stuff is gone! Brilliantly captured. Love the coat hangers. One critisizm, the model is little fuzzy, while the focus is one the reflection, I don''t know if this was on purpose... Great work!', '2003-06-19 15:04:47.000000', NULL, 0),
