(367721, 12902, 8953, '<td valign="top">I have a daughter that lost her baby (my first grandbaby) just a couple weeks ago. it seemed fortunate that the loss was early in her pregnancy, but the pain is still there. Loss is loss, regardless of when. Thank You Sonifo for the wonderful expression.<br/>Richard</td>', 'I have a daughter that lost her baby (my first grandbaby) just a couple weeks ago. it seemed fortunate that the loss was early in her pregnancy, but the pain is still there. Loss is loss, regardless of when. Thank You Sonifo for the wonderful expression.Richard', '2003-07-27 12:26:14.000000', NULL, 0),
